"P487059719" "Dual Blades"
// DisplayHelp :
"P483121293" "You are a master of fighting with a blade in each hand.  Your precision and skill with the blades enable you to strike in numerous combinations, each of which has unique secondary effects on a target which withstands your onslaught."

