"P2262393014" "Nimble Slash"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2681764275" "Melee, Minor DMG(Lethal)"
// Power Help Text :
"P1016003190" "A quick swipe with your blades. Does minor lethal damage, but has a quick recharge rate. This attack begins both the Empower and Weaken combination attacks. Damage: Minor, Recharge: Very Fast"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P1026516307" "You shred {PlayerDest} with your {PowerName} for {Damage} points of lethal damage!"
