"P2030720894" "Power Slice"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2492361561" "Melee, Moderate DMG(Lethal)"
// Power Help Text :
"P766264082" "You perform a deadly Strike with your blades. This is a basic attack that deals a moderate amount of lethal damage. This power is needed for the Sweep combination attack. Damage: Moderate, Recharge: Fast"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P2012838404" "Your {PowerName} slices {PlayerDest} for {Damage} points of lethal damage!"

