// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3465884966" "Melee, Moderate DMG(Lethal), Foe -DEF"
// Power Help Text :
"P2270872584" "You Slash at your foe with your blades, dealing a good amount of lethal damage. This attack can reduce a target's Defense, making him easier to hit. This power is needed for the Empower and Weaken combination attacks, and is the beginning of the Attack Vitals combination attack. Damage: Moderate, Recharge: Fast"
