"P3747886100" "Melee, Light DMG(Lethal), Self +DMG, +To Hit"
// Power Help Text :
"P776014607" "You perform a feint attack that deals light damage. After this attack hits, it gives you a large bonus to your chance to hit and damage for a brief time. This power is the finishing move in the Empower combination attack. Damage: Light, Recharge: Slow"
