"P3211390344" "Melee, High DMG(Lethal), Knockdown"
// Power Help Text :
"P1735853191" "Unleashes a series of strong attacks on your foe, dealing high lethal damage and knocking them down. This power is needed for the Attack Vitals combination attack. Damage: High, Recharge: Moderate"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P3605950396" "Your {PowerName} strikes {PlayerDest} for {Damage} points of lethal damage!"
