"P1223095199" "Claws"
// DisplayHelp :
"P2245679945" "Claws are bones or blades that extend from your hands and cause Lethal damage. The lightweight, natural feel of claws gives this power set a reduced Endurance cost and faster attack rate than other Scrapper melee sets. Like all scrapper powers, all Claw attacks can sometimes land a critical hit for double damage."

