"P888087193" "Opens up your assault rifle on Full Auto to lay down a massive spray of bullets at your target. Although very slow to reload, damage from this attack is massive, shredding all targets within the narrow cone of effect. There's a chance you may land a lucky shot for extra damage. Damage: Superior(DoT), Recharge: Slow"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P1469631429" "You shred {PlayerDest} with your Assault Rifle for {Damage} points of lethal damage!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P946198095" "{PlayerSource} shreds you with a Full Auto Barrage for {Damage} points of lethal damage!"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P2140028754" "You land a lucky shot and hit {PlayerDest} for an extra {Damage} points of lethal damage!"

// ******************************************************************************** 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Set : Fire Blast 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayName :
"P4178945378" "Fire Blast"
// DisplayHelp :
"P516947913" "Fire Blast allows you to blast fire at foes, with a tendency to set them ablaze for added damage over time."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Flares 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P828916130" "Flares"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P837547298" "Ranged, Minor DMG(Fire)"
// Power Help Text :
"P3057747535" "A quick attack that throws Flares at the target. Little damage, but very fast. Damage: Minor, Recharge: Very Fast"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P1437075981" "You are on fire and burning!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P2113838434" "{PlayerSource} pelts you with their {PowerName} for {Damage} points of fire damage!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P2027331186" "You continue to burn from the {PowerName} for {Damage} points of fire damage!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Fire Blast 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P282569673" "Ranged, Moderate DMG(Fire)"
// Power Help Text :
"P3599208445" "Sends a Blast of Fire at a targeted foe and sets the target on fire for a short period of time. Slower recharge rate than Flares, but more damage. Damage: Moderate, Recharge: Fast"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P3200596956" "{PlayerSource} blasts you with their {PowerName} for {Damage} points of fire damage!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Fire Ball 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2473499941" "Fire Ball"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3748902731" "Ranged (Targeted AoE), Moderate DMG(Fire/Smash)"
// Power Help Text :
"P931455852" "Hurls an exploding Fireball that consumes a targeted foe, and all nearby enemies. Anyone in that explosion is burned and set ablaze. Damage: Moderate, Recharge: Slow"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P3986528636" "Your {PowerName} explodes on {PlayerDest} for {Damage} points of smashing damage!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P4009624198" "{PlayerSource} explodes a Fireball on you for {Damage} points of smashing damage!"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P3973912412" "Your {PowerName} explodes on {PlayerDest} for {Damage} points of fire damage!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P122115958" "{PlayerSource} explodes a Fireball on you for {Damage} points of fire damage!"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P1355056291" "Your {PowerName} continues to burn for {Damage} points of fire damage!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P1859584071" "You continue to burn from the Fireball for {Damage} points of fire damage!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Rain of Fire 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3251690108" "Rain of Fire"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3325761542" "Ranged (Location AoE), Minor DoT(Fire)"
// Power Help Text :
"P23529690" "Summons a Rain of Fire over a targeted location, burning foes within a large area. Damage: Minor(DoT), Recharge: Long"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Fire Breath 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2101271196" "Fire Breath"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1663310391" "Close (Cone), Moderate DoT(Fire)"
// Power Help Text :
"P3542949567" "You can breathe forth a torrent of fire that burns all foes within its narrow cone. Very accurate and very deadly at medium range. Damage: Moderate(DoT), Recharge: Slow"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Aim 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Blaze 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P888934707" "Blaze"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1136951310" "Close, High DMG(Fire)"
// Power Help Text :
"P4255124688" "A short range, but devastating flame attack. Damage: High, Recharge: Slow"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Inferno 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P361595644" "Inferno"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3360089935" "PBAoE, Extreme DMG(Fire/Smash), Self -Recovery"
// Power Help Text :
"P3094366122" "Unleashes a massive fiery explosion to devastate all nearby enemies and set them ablaze. Inferno deals massive damage to all nearby foes, although the damage does vary.  Activating this power leaves you drained of Endurance and unable to recover Endurance for a while. Damage: Extreme, Recharge: Very Long"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P2064308844" "You devastate {PlayerDest} with your {PowerName} for a whopping {Damage} points of fire damage."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P2590356541" "{PlayerSource} devastates you with their {PowerName} for a whopping {Damage} points of fire damage!"

// ******************************************************************************** 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Set : Devices 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayName :
// DisplayShortHelp :
"P3736762118" "Devices"
// DisplayHelp :
"P3131182314" "Devices are equipment you have constructed for use in combat. By using them strategically, you can gain a great tactical advantage. Traps, non-lethal munitions, and demolitions are available in this power set."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Web Grenade 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1642214998" "Ranged, Target Immobilize, -Recharge, -Fly"
// Power Help Text :
"P153366950" "Upon impact, the Web Grenade expels a strong, tenuous, and very sticky substance that can Immobilize most targets. This non-lethal device deals no damage and does not prevent targets from attacking, although their attack rate is Slowed. The Web can bring down flying entities and halts jumping. Recharge: Fast"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P3505771407" "Immobilize, -Fly, -Recharge"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P1730420478" "You have been caught in a web.  You cannot move or fly and your attack speed is reduced."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P3858553300" "You hit {PlayerDest} with a {PowerName}, slowing their attack and movement rate!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P3046173935" "{PlayerSource} hits you with a {PowerName}, slowing your movement rate and attack speed!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Caltrops 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3697396555" "Ranged (Location AoE), Minor DoT(Lethal), Foe -Speed"
// Power Help Text :
"P1505439020" "You toss a handful of Caltrops at a targeted location and spread the tiny metal spikes over a large area. Any villains that pass over the Caltrops will be forced to move at a slower rate. They will also take some trivial Lethal damage over time. Damage: Minor(DoT), Recharge: Slow"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P1637966331" "DoT(Lethal), -SPD"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P1306558302" "The caltrops are causing minor damage to you and slowing your running speed."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P1814112202" "You drop {PowerName} on the ground!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Taser 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2163307709" "Melee, Foe Disorient"
// Power Help Text :
"P2812891851" "The Taser is basically a stun-gun. This small device releases a high-voltage, low-amperage electrical charge that can Disorient most opponents with minimal damage. The Taser has a very short range. Damage: Minor, Recharge: Slow"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P3898766538" "{PlayerDest} is hit for {Damage} points of energy damage by your {PowerName}."
// Effect VictimHit Message :

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Targeting Drone 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P265520239" "Targeting Drone"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3149431041" "Toggle: Self +To-hit, +Perception, Res(DeBuff ToHit)"
// Power Help Text :
"P1762962678" "When this small device is activated, the small Targeting Drone hovers around your head and emits targeting laser sights. The lasers can dramatically improve your chance to hit and increase your Perception, allowing you to better see stealthy foes. Targeting Drone also grants you resistance to powers that DeBuff your chance to hit. While in use, any sniper rifle shots you make will do additional damage.  This is a toggle power and must be activated and deactivated manually. Like all toggle powers, while active, the Targeting Drone drains Endurance. Recharge: Slow"
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P2981565818" "Your {PowerName} increases your chance to hit."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Smoke Grenade 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P810634828" "Smoke Grenade"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2290415540" "Ranged (Target AoE), Foe -Perception, -To-hit"
// Power Help Text :
"P3871196796" "The Smoke Grenade envelops all those in the affected area in a cloud of smoke. Most villains will not be able to see past normal melee range, although some may have better perception. If the villains are attacked, they will be alerted to your presence, but will suffer a penalty to their chance to hit. Recharge: Slow"
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P3070891156" "Your {PowerName} hits {PlayerDest} slightly reducing their chance to hit and dramatically reducing their perception!"
// Power VictimHit Message :
"P503998744" "{PlayerSource} hits you with a {PowerName} slightly decreasing your chance to hit and dramatically reducing your perception!"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P1309664148" "-Perception, -To-hit"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P1010802951" "Your visual range and chance to hit have been reduced by the Smoke Grenade."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Auto Turret 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2366053991" "Gun Drone"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P645443609" "Build Turret: Ranged, Moderate DMG(Lethal)"
// Power Help Text :
"P352017385" "You can summon a Gun Drone. The Drone has an extremely fast fire rate and is equipped with a customized tracking system. Once locked on, the Drone will continue to unload a volley of lead into the target until it is destroyed. The Drone is armored, but can be destroyed. Damage: Moderate, Recharge: Very Long"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P3912486950" "You set up a {PowerName}!"

// ******************************************************************************** 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Set : Energy Manipulation 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayName :
"P2226253212" "Energy Manipulation"
// DisplayHelp :
"P665753676" "Energy Manipulation allows you to channel energy to deliver deadly blows. These powers also help you focus your power to increase your own abilities."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Power Thrust 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1493180471" "Power Thrust"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2819972049" "Melee, Minor DMG(Energy/Smash), Foe Knockback"
// Power Help Text :
"P3814291652" "A focused attack that violently shoves the target and sends them flying. Deals minimal damage, but can be very effective. Damage: Minor, Recharge: Moderate"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P2825342372" "Your {PowerName} sends {PlayerDest} flying and deals {Damage} points of smashing damage."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P2647805777" "{PlayerSource} sends you flying with {PowerName} and deals {Damage} points of energy damage to you!"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P3925593921" "Your {PowerName} sends {PlayerDest} flying and deals {Damage} points of energy damage."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Build Up 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P3659576318" "You tap into your inner strength with your {PowerName} and are more deadly for a short while."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Bone Smasher 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3590742113" "Melee, High DMG(Smash/Energy), Foe Disorient"
// Power Help Text :
"P1862628577" "The Bone Smasher is a slow attack, but makes up for it with a good amount of damage. Has a greater chance to Disorient than Energy Punch. Damage: High, Recharge: Moderate"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Stun 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1397128752" "Stun"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3524183702" "Melee, Minor DMG(Energy/Smashing), Foe Disorient"
// Power Help Text :
"P3972036257" "Stun deals a little bit of damage, but Disorients its target a great deal. This attack can Disorient most opponents. Damage: Minor, Recharge: Slow"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Power Boost 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P314575027" "Power Boost"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3047510863" "Self +Special"
// Power Help Text :
"P3678278179" "Greatly boosts the secondary effects of your powers. Your powers effects like Heals, Defense Buffs, Endurance Drains, Disorients, Holds, Immobilizes, Knockbacks and more, are all improved. The effects of Power Boost last a short while, and only the next couple of attacks will be boosted. Recharge: Long"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P3834136190" "You tap into your inner power and boost the abilities of your next few attacks."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Boost Range 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P4020626791" "Boost Range"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2758840513" "Self Range Increase"
// Power Help Text :
"P1216787664" "You can boost your powers to increase the range of your next few attacks. Recharge: Long"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P351929251" "You focus your inner power and increase the range of your next few attacks."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Total Focus 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// ******************************************************************************** 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Set : Electricity Manipulation 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayName :
"P1946984256" "Electricity Manipulation"
// DisplayHelp :
"P3825514593" "Electricity Manipulation empowers you with various electrical melee attack and support powers. Electricity Manipulation powers can drain foes' Endurance and temporarily halt their Endurance recovery.  Some powers return a portion of drained Endurance to you."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Electric Fence 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1082437617" "Electric Fence"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3536834546" "Ranged, Moderate DoT(Energy), Foe Immobilize, -End"
// Power Help Text :
"P1283732797" "Surrounds and Immobilizes a single target in an Electric Fence. Deals some damage over time and slowly drains some Endurance. Useful for keeping villains at bay. Damage: Minor(DoT), Recharge: Fast"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P3462979101" "You are immobilized by the Electric Fence."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P3385120024" "Your {PowerName} electrocutes {PlayerDest} for {Damage} points of energy damage."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P306078268" "{PlayerSource} electrocutes you with their {PowerName} for {Damage} points of energy damage!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Charged Brawl 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1248113303" "Melee, Moderate DMG(Smash/Energy), Target Sleep, -End"
// Power Help Text :
"P3090349447" "Your fists become electrically charged and deliver a powerful punch. Charged Brawl can drain some Endurance from the target and may overload their synapses, leaving them writhing for a moment.  A portion of drained Endurance may be returned to you.  Disturbing an overloaded target will disperse the electrical charge and release them. Damage: Moderate, Recharge: Fast"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P2206315550" "You have been put to sleep by the Charged Brawl attack."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P2546089089" "Your {PowerName} overloads {PlayerDest} and puts them to sleep temporarily!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P3730862805" "{PlayersSource} overloads your synapses with their {PowerName}, and temporarily puts you to sleep!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Lightning Field 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2253856063" "Lightning Field"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2938625842" "Toggle: PBAoE, Minor DoT(Energy), Foe -End"
// Power Help Text :
"P3624158687" "While active, you emit a storm of electricity that constantly damages all nearby foes. Damage: Minor(DoT), Recharge: Slow"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P2516347203" "You are taking damage from the Lightning Field."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P410385832" "{PowerName} shocks {PlayerDest} for {Damage} points of energy damage."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Havoc Punch 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1572818336" "Melee, High DMG(Smash/Energy), Foe Sleep, -End, Knock back"
// Power Help Text :
"P4085000516" "The Havoc Punch is a slower attack than Charged Brawl, but makes up for it with a greater damage. Havoc Punch can may knock down targets, drain some Endurance from your target, or even overload their synapses, leaving them writhing for a moment.  A portion of the drained Endurance may be given back to you.  Disturbing an overloaded target will disperse the electrical charge and release them. Damage: Moderate, Recharge: Moderate"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P1252614011" "You have been put to sleep by the Havok Punch."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Build Up 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Help Text :
"P2405091729" "Greatly boosts your attacks for a few seconds. Slightly increases chance to hit. Recharge: Long"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P2170841177" "You tap into your inner power with your {PowerName} and are more deadly for a short while."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Lightning Clap 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Thunder Strike 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2791213138" "Melee (AoE), High DMG(Smash, Energy), Foe Disorient, Knockback"
// Power Help Text :
"P4018294709" "A massive attack. You smash your foes with all the power of a lightning bolt. The pummeled victim takes tremendous damage and may be Disoriented. Any nearby foes may be knocked down and take some damage from the shockwave. Damage: High, Recharge: Slow"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P1354998770" "Your {PowerName} deals {Damage} points of energy Damage to {PlayerDest}."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P2482875288" "The explosion from Thunder Strike blasts you for {Damage} points of energy damage."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Power Sink 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2664724052" "Power Sink"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3080198159" "PBAoE, Self +End, Foe -End"
// Power Help Text :
"P2353135322" "Power Sink leeches energy directly from the bodies of all nearby foes, draining their Endurance. Each foe you draw energy from increases your Endurance. If there are no foes within range, you will not gain any Endurance. Recharge: Long"

// ******************************************************************************** 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Set : Fire Manipulation 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayName :
"P3763707613" "Fire Manipulation"
// DisplayHelp :
"P1302811860" "Fire Manipulation lets you surround yourself with various manifestations of fire and flames, assaulting and burning nearby foes. Fire Manipulation powers tend to set foes ablaze for added damage over time."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Ring of Fire 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P896308763" "Ring of Fire"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P369354458" "Ranged, Moderate DoT(Fire), Foe Immobilize"
// Power Help Text :
"P2416451190" "Immobilizes your target in a Ring of Fire. Deals some damage over time. Useful for keeping villains at bay. Damage: Moderate(DoT), Recharge: Medium"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P3790181359" "DoT(Fire), Immobilize."
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P3932209823" "The Ring of Fire is burning you and holding you motionless."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Fire Sword 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Help Text :
"P3569282890" "Through concentration, you can create a sword of fire that can set foes ablaze. Successful attacks from the Fire Sword will ignite your target, dealing damage over time. Damage: Moderate, Recharge: Moderate"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P3745662413" "The Fire Sword has caught you on fire."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Combustion 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1286834232" "Combustion"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1499190117" "Melee (AoE), Moderate DoT(Fire)"
// Power Help Text :
"P3876623488" "Your mastery of fire allows you to violently raise the temperature around yourself in an attempt to spontaneously combust any nearby foes and set them ablaze, dealing damage over time. Damage: Moderate(DoT), Recharge: Slow"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P3378124801" "You have spontaneously combusted!  You are burning!"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P2119308348" "You burn {PlayerDest} for {Damage} points of fire damage from your {PowerName}."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P1497148225" "You continue to burn {PlayerDest} for {Damage} points of fire damage from your {PowerName}."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P358447693" "{PlayerSource} continues to burn you with their {PowerName} for {Damage} points of fire damage!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Fire Sword Circle 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Help Text :
"P1768475407" "Mastery of your Fire Sword has enabled you to make an attack on every foe within melee distance. This will slash and burn your enemies, dealing minor damage and setting them ablaze. Damage: Moderate, Recharge: Slow"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P2568784365" "{PlayerSource} scorches you with their mighty {PowerName} for {Damage} points of fire damage!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Build Up 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3257909236" "Self +DMG +To-hit"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P3210332304" "You tap into your inner fire with your {PowerName} and are more deadly for a short while."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Hot Feet 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P207060483" "Hot Feet"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1558454045" "Toggle: PBAoE, Minor DoT(Fire), Foe -SPD"
// Power Help Text :
"P421213737" "While active, you heat the earth in a large area around yourself. Enemy movement is Slowed as they attempt to flee the immediate area. All foes in the affected area may also suffer some damage over time.  You cannot fly and must be near the ground to use this power. Damage: Minor(DoT), Recharge: Slow"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P3546334860" "DoT(Fire), -SPD"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P4244456786" "The ground below you is incredibly hot.  You are burning and your running speed is reduced."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P3915300578" "You activate {PowerName} and burn {PlayerDest} for {Damage} points of fire damage, and Slow their movement speed."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P3652138800" "{PlayerSource} heats the ground around them, burning your feet for {Damage} points of fire damage!"

// ******************************************************************************** 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Set : Ice Manipulation 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayName :
"P3587557651" "Ice Manipulation"
// DisplayHelp :
"P703220945" "Ice Manipulation lets you surround yourself with various manifestations of ice and cold, assaulting and freezing nearby foes. Ice Manipulation powers are known to Slow opponents."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Chilblain 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2787247941" "Chilblain"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1689686328" "Ranged, Moderate DoT(Cold), Foe Immobilize, -SPD, -Recharge"
// Power Help Text :
"P4120815874" "Immobilizes your target in an icy trap. Deals some damage over time and slightly Slows the target's attack and movement speed. Useful for keeping villains at bay. Damage: Moderate(DoT),  Recharge: Fast"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P96383474" "DoT(Cold), Immobilize, -Recharge, -SPD"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P432879336" "You have been frozen in place.  Your Attack speed and Running speed are reduced and you are freezing."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P3531357424" "Your {PowerName} freezes {PlayerDest} for {Damage} points of cold damage."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Frozen Fists 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1581377710" "Melee, Moderate DMG(Cold/Smash), Foe -Recharge, -SPD"
// Power Help Text :
"P896202556" "Frozen Fists encrusts your hands in ice, giving them the ability to quickly inflict moderate damage on villains. The foe's attack and movement speed is Slowed, due to the chills caused by the cold blows. Damage: Moderate  Recharge: Fast"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P959962286" "You have been chilled by the Frozen Fists.  Your Attack speed and Running speed are reduced."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P2345867456" "You chill {PlayerDest} with your {PowerName} for {Damage} points of cold damage!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Ice Sword 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Help Text :
"P4223563314" "You create a blade of solid ice that deals higher damage then Frozen Fists. Being hit by this Ice Sword will Slow a target's movement and attack speed, due to the intense chill. Damage: Moderate, Recharge: Moderate"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P1146445504" "You have been chilled by the Ice Sword.  Your Attack speed and Running speed are reduced."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P763567717" "Your mighty {PowerName} freezes {PlayerDest} for {Damage} points of cold damage and slows their attack and movement speed!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Chilling Embrace 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Build Up 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P3319085777" "You tap into your inner core with your {PowerName} and are more deadly for a short while."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Ice Patch 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Help Text :
"P457115470" "You emanate a patch of ice around you, which causes foes that step onto it to slip and fall down. This effect lasts until the ice melts. You must be near the ground to activate this power. Recharge: Slow"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Shiver 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P575259887" "Shiver"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3242282090" "Ranged (Cone), Foe -SPD, -Recharge"
// Power Help Text :
"P3925256144" "You can blast forth a wide cone of chilling air that dramatically Slows the movement and attack rate of nearby foes. Recharge: Slow"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P111144399" "You are shivering.  Your Attack rate and Running speed are reduced."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P2996323216" "Your {PowerName} dramatically Slows the attack speed and movement of {PlayerDest}!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P1239501892" "{PlayerSource} Slows you with their {PowerName}!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Freezing Touch 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1341908633" "Melee, Minor DMG(Cold), Foe Hold"
// Power Help Text :
"P622635638" "This Freezing Touch will encase a single foe in a block of ice. This will deal minor damage as well as freezing them in their tracks, leaving them cold and helpless. Damage: Minor, Recharge: Slow"
