"P1673146990" "You are frozen solid by the Freezing Touch."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P3745356051" "Your {PowerName} freezes {PlayerDest} in their tracks!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P3409068521" "{PlayerSource} freezes you in your tracks with their {PowerName}!"

