"P1446475898" "Mental Manipulation"
// DisplayHelp :
"P638004667" "Manipulate your enemies with an array of offensive Psionic powers. Few living beings can resist their effects. Creatures without minds, however, like machines and robots, are much more resistant."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Subdual 
