"P3922733425" "Subdual"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P4001340883" "Ranged, Moderate DOT(Psionic), Foe Immobilize"
// Power Help Text :
"P3976101363" "Subdual deals moderate Psionic damage and may leave the targeted foe Immobilized for a brief time. Immobilized foes cannot move but can still attack. Damage: Moderate, Recharge: Moderate"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P1914949175" "You blast {PlayerDest} with your {PowerName} for {Damage} points of damage and attempt to Immobilize them!"

