// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1679540511" "Melee, Minor DMG(Psionic/Smash), Foe Knockback"
// Power Help Text :
"P4199507670" "A focused attack or intense mental power that violently sends a nearby foe flying. Deals minimal damage, but can be very effective. Damage: Minor, Recharge: Moderate"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P512169650" "{PlayerSource} hits you with a {PowerName} for {Damage} points of damage, and sends you flying!"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P1644495752" "Your {PowerName} sends {PlayerDest} flying and deals {Damage} points of psionic damage."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
