"P2457338166" "Empathy"
// DisplayHelp :
"P2304849589" "Empathy gives you the ability to heal and aid allies as well as yourself.  Empathy has no offensive powers, but its heals and buffs are unmatched."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
