// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Clear Mind 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2171100930" "Clear Mind"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3882233887" "Ally +Res(Disorient, Hold, Sleep, Immobilize, Fear, Confuse), +Perception"
// Power Help Text :
"P3511927004" "Frees an ally from any Disorient, Hold, Sleep, Fear, Confuse and Immobilize effects and leaves them resistant to such effects for a good while. Also, grants target clearer Perception to see hidden foes. Protection will improve with Multiple applications and as you advance in level. Recharge: Fast"
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P1987621853" "You protect {PlayerDest} from Disorient, Hold, Sleep, Fear, Confuse and Immobilize effects with your {PowerName} power."
// Power VictimHit Message :
"P2884066914" "{PlayerSource} protects you from Disorient, Hold, Sleep, Fear, Confuse and Immobilize effects."
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P1474485343" "+Res(Disorient, Hold, Sleep, Immobilize, Fear, Confuse), +Perception"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P3640605281" "Your mind has been cleared of negative effects, and you are granted temporary resistance to Disorient, Hold, Sleep, Fear, Confuse and Immobilize effects and your Perception is improved."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Fortitude 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3070419417" "Fortitude"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P85528276" "Ally +DEF(All), +DMG, +To-hit"
// Power Help Text :
"P1239296913" "Fortitude immensely enhances a single ally's chance to hit, Damage, and Defense to all attacks. Recharge: Long"
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P2859236327" "You greatly increase the To Hit, Damage and Defense of {PlayerDest}."
// Power VictimHit Message :
"P3885102710" "{PlayerSource} greatly increases your To Hit, Damage and Defense."
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P517609047" "+DEF, +DMG, +To-hit"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P2714278848" "You have been given the gift of Fortitude.  Your chance to hit, Damage and Defense to all attacks have all been increased."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Recovery Aura 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3826125234" "Recovery Aura"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3682556562" "PBAoE, Ally +Recovery"
// Power Help Text :
"P1027281680" "The Recovery Aura dramatically increases the Endurance recovery rate of all nearby heroes for a limited time. Emitting this Aura costs you a lot of Endurance, and it takes a long time to recharge. Recharge: Very Long"
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P1138309770" "You increase the Endurance Recovery of {PlayerDest}."
// Power VictimHit Message :
"P4278187717" "{PlayerSource} increases your Endurance Recovery."
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P2310678054" "+Recovery"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P2288653983" "The Recovery Aura is improving your Endurance Recovery Rate, allowing you to battle longer!"

// ******************************************************************************** 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Set : Force Field 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayName :
"P2006157955" "Force Field"
// DisplayHelp :
"P3596894212" "The Force Field powers give you the ability to create shells of energy that protect yourself and your allies from various forms of damage and harm.  Force Fields do not reduce damage, but reduced your allies chance of getting hit in the first place."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Personal Force Field 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3978803010" "Personal Force Field"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3850683110" "Toggle: Self +Def, Res(All)"
// Power Help Text :
"P2723592640" "The Personal Force Field is almost impenetrable to all attacks, even Psionics and Enemy Teleportation, although attacks from more powerful foes may get through more easily. Personal Force Field will also reduce the damage of any attacks that do get through. The Personal Force Field works both ways; while it is active, you can only use powers that affect yourself. Cannot be used with Rest. Recharge: Slow"
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P3782792257" "Your {PowerName} makes you virtually invulnerable to most attacks, but you can only cast powers on yourself while the Force Field is active."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Force Bolt 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3532762553" "Force Bolt"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1949322042" "Ranged, Minor DMG(Smash), Foe Knockback"
// Power Help Text :
"P1133545432" "Discharges a bolt of force that knocks down foes and deals some Smashing Damage. Damage: Minor, Recharge: Fast"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P524369720" "{PlayerSource} pounds you with a {PowerName} for {Damage} points of smashing damage!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Deflection Shield 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1823934049" "Deflection Shield"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1152404173" "Ranged, Ally +DEF(Smash, Lethal, Melee), Res(Toxic)"
// Power Help Text :
"P1966278961" "Dramatically protects an ally from Smashing, Lethal and all Melee attacks for a limited time.  Also reduces Toxic damage. You cannot stack multiple Deflection Shields on the same target; however, the shield can be improved by another ally using the same power. Can also be used in conjunction with your Insulation Shield. You cannot use this power on yourself. Recharge: Very Fast"
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P737094794" "You protect {PlayerDest} from Smashing, Lethal and Melee attacks, as well as Toxic Damage, with your {PowerName}."
// Power VictimHit Message :
"P2660225500" "{PlayerSource} protects you from Smashing, Lethal and Melee attacks with a {PowerName} and grants you some resistance to Toxic damage."
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P2240545096" "+DEF(Smash, Lethal, Melee), Res(Toxic)"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P639359596" "You have been encased in a Deflection Shield.  Your Defense to Smashing, Lethal and Melee attacks is increased, and your ability to resist Toxic attacks is increased as well."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Detention Field 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3517858636" "Detention Field"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3258422862" "Ranged, Foe Capture (Special)"
// Power Help Text :
"P1774286945" "Encases a targeted foe in a Detention Force Field. The captured target cannot be harmed, is Immobilized, and cannot attack or aid their allies. The target can, however, use powers on themselves. Recharge: Slow"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P1145282425" "Capture"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P3938244390" "You have been captured in a Detention Field.  You cannot be harmed, however, you can only use powers which affect yourself."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P2641364819" "You encase {PlayerDest} in an impenetrable {PowerName}.  They cannot move and can only affect themselves now."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P1053776284" "{PlayerSource} encases you in an impenetrable {PowerName}. You cannot move and can only affect yourself!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Aid Self 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P916602661" "Aid Self"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2475714968" "Self Heal, Res(Disorient)"
// Power Help Text :
"P619931250" "Allows you to heal yourself. This hypo also leaves you wide awake, and resistant to Disorientation effects. This power is interruptible. You must be at least level 14 and have Aid Other or Stimulant before selecting Aid Self."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P3634478623" "You heal yourself for {Damage} hit points with {PowerName}.  You are resistant to Disorient."

