"P851023681" "Oil Slick Arrow"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2794896108" "Ranged (Location AoE), Knockdown, -Speed, -DEF, +Special"
// Power Help Text :
"P938977739" "On impact, this arrow creates an oil slick that Slows foes in the area and may cause them to slip and fall. The oil slick is very flammable and may burst into flames if fire is used near it. Recharge: Long"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P3605848267" "-SPD"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P1007677818" "The oil slick has reduced your running speed."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P4100491214" "You coat the ground in oil from your {PowerName}!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : EMP Arrow 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P993615740" "EMP Arrow"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1500918562" "AoE, Foe Hold, Special vs. Robots, Self -Recovery"
// Power Help Text :
"P2063198606" "This arrow can unleash a massive pulse of electromagnetic energy on impact. This EMP can affect machines, and is even powerful enough to affect synaptic brain patterns. It will incapacitate all foes in its radius. Additionally, most machines and robots will take moderate high damage. However, this power uses a lot of Endurance and leaves you unable to recover Endurance for a while. Recharge: Very Long"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P3549109959" "You are held immobile by the EMP Pulse and your Regeneration Rate is reduced."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P1371424338" "{PlayerSource} blasts you for {Damage} points of energy damage with their {PowerName}."

// ******************************************************************************** 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Set : Earth Control 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayName :
"P3825861070" "Earth Control"
// DisplayHelp :
"P1212332936" "You can control the forces of the Earth. You can manipulate earth and stone to defeat your foes. The crushing force of many Earth Powers can reduce a target's Defense. Being of the Earth, many of these powers need to be performed while on the ground."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Stone Prison 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1247417221" "Stone Prison"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P153652083" "Ranged, Moderate DoT(Smash), Foe Immobilize, -DEF, -Fly"
// Power Help Text :
"P2944472620" "Immobilizes a single target within an earthy formation and deals some Smashing damage over time. Some more resilient foes may require multiple attacks to Immobilize. Stone Prison can also reduce a target's Defense. Damage: Moderate(DoT), Recharge: Fast"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P1935306243" "DoT(Smashing), Immobilize, -Fly, -DEF"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P3639973498" "You are being crushed by a Stone Prison.  You are immobile and cannot fly.  Your Defenses are reduced."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P1969162134" "Your {PowerName} crushes {PlayerDest} for {Damage} points of smashing damage and reduces their Defense!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P2803527962" "{PlayerSource} crushes you with their {PowerName} for {Damage} points of smashing damage and reduces your defense!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P422814428" "{PlayerSource} immobilized you with their {PowerName}!"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P3786851416" "Your Immobilization of {PlayerDest} with your {PowerName} was even more powerful!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P1816503069" "{PlayerSource} lands an extra strong immobilization on you with their {PowerName}!"
// DisplayFloat :
"P2144434522" "Overpower"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Fossilize 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
