"P1486930030" "Fossilize"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2785664101" "Ranged, Moderate DMG(Smash), Foe Hold, -DEF"
// Power Help Text :
"P3626648717" "Encases a single target within solid stone. The stone slowly crushes the victim, dealing Smashing damage. The Fossilized victim is held helpless and unable to defend themselves. Damage, Moderate, Recharge: Moderate"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P2688767313" "You have been Fossilized and are held.  Your Defenses are reduced."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P4034150122" "Your hold on {PlayerDest} with your {PowerName} was even more powerful!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P287351733" "{PlayerSource} lands an extra strong hold on you with their {PowerName}!"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P4041620612" "Your {PowerName} crushes {PlayerDest} for {Damage} points of smashing damage and reduce their Defense!"

