// Power : Stone Cages 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3979830685" "Stone Cages"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3337138154" "Ranged AoE, Minor DMG(Smash), Foe Immobilize, -Fly, -DEF"
// Power Help Text :
"P141045042" "Immobilizes a group of foes within earthy formations and deals some Smashing damage over time. Slower and less damaging than Stone Prison, but can capture multiple targets. Stone Cages can also reduce a target's Defense. Damage: Minor(DoT), Recharge: Moderate"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P3762208533" "You are being crushed by a Stone Cage.  You are immobile and cannot fly.  Your Defenses are reduced."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Quicksand 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2550309372" "Quicksand"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3983502767" "Ranged (Location AoE), Foe -Speed, -Jump, -Fly, -DEF"
// Power Help Text :
"P2498429095" "You can cause the ground to liquefy like Quicksand at a targeted location. Any foes that pass through the Quicksand will become snared, their movement will be dramatically Slowed, and their Defense reduced. Foes trapped in the Quicksand cannot jump or Fly. Recharge: Slow"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
