// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P339426154" "Your Running speed, Jump height and Defense are reduced by the Quicksand."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P1397656559" "You turn the ground into {PowerName}!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Stalagmites 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P619119382" "Stalagmites"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P670800542" "Ranged (Targeted AoE), Minor DMG(Lethal), Foe Disorient, -DEF"
// Power Help Text :
"P608838145" "You can cause Stalagmites to erupt all around an enemy, damaging all nearby foes. The Stalagmites deal minimal Lethal damage, and can Disorient all affected targets for a good while, as well as reduce their Defense. You must be on the ground  to activate this power.  Damage: Minor, Recharge: Slow"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P1759839650" "The Stalagmites have Disoriented you and left your Defenses reduced."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P647880873" "Your {PowerName} pierce {PlayerDest} for {Damage} points of lethal damage and reduce their Defense!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P597438158" "{PlayerSource} pierces you with their {PowerName} for {Damage} points of lethal damage and reduces your defense!"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P1379153483" "Your stun on {PlayerDest} with your {PowerName} was even more powerful!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P4027725363" "{PlayerSource} lands an extra strong stun on you with their {PowerName}!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Earthquake 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2825109994" "Earthquake"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P672419762" "Ranged (Location AoE), Foe Knockback, -To-hit, -Def"
// Power Help Text :
"P2794685333" "Generates a powerful, localized Earthquake. Most foes that pass through the location will fall down. The violent shaking also reduces their chance to hit and Defense. Recharge: Slow"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P643314801" "You cause the very earth to shake!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Volcanic Gasses 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P497353619" "Volcanic Gasses"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3571207657" "Ranged (Location AoE), Foe Hold, Minor DoT(Fire), Special"
// Power Help Text :
"P3781829949" "You can tap into the geothermal power of the Earth and focus it at a targeted location. Foes that pass near a thermal vent will take minor Fire damage and be overcome by the gasses, leaving them choking and helpless. Damage: Minor(DoT), Recharge: Very Long"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P1580114403" "Hold, DoT(Fire)"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P1012408864" "The Volcanic Gasses are burning you and preventing you from acting."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P4176979480" "{PowerName} erupt from the ground!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Animate Stone 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P40838925" "Animate Stone"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1044847527" "Summon Golem: Melee Heavy DMG(Smashing)"
// Power Help Text :
"P3931835091" "Earth and stone coalesce to form an incredibly tough entity that can attack your foes. The Animated Stone is not alive and is immune to Psionic damage. It is also virtually immune to Sleep, Immobilize, Disorient, and Hold effects. The entity can be healed and buffed like any teammate. Type ''/release_pets'' in the chat window to release all your pets. Recharge: Very Long"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P388854299" "The earth forms into an animated entity and awaits your command!"

// ******************************************************************************** 
