"P1633927064" "Ranged (Location AoE), Minor DMG(Fire), Foe Knockback"
// Power Help Text :
"P3124133998" "You can create a Bonfire that knocks back and burns any foes who try to pass through it. Recharge: Long"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
