"P638235624" "Fire Imps"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1781968311" "Summon Imps: Melee Minor DMG(Fire)"
// Power Help Text :
"P875455116" "You can craft 3 small Fire Imps out of pure flame in a targeted location. Fire Imps will viciously attack any nearby foes, but they only possess the most basic instincts. Fire Imps can be healed and buffed like any teammate. Type ''/release_pets'' in the chat window to release all your pets. Recharge: Very Long"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P1757360070" "You call forth Three {PowerName} of dancing flame!"

