// DisplayName :
"P1534949257" "Gravity Control"
// DisplayHelp :
"P2972185514" "This power set allows you to manipulate the forces of gravity to control your foes. Enemies have little defense against Gravity powers."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Crush 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P218551415" "Crush"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P4101882003" "Ranged, Moderate DoT(Smash), Foe Immobilize, -Fly"
// Power Help Text :
"P550474006" "Creates a localized gravitational field strong enough to Immobilize a single foe. Crush can also bring down flying entities. This power deals Smashing damage over time and can Slow the movement of targets that escape its grasp. Damage: Moderate(DoT), Recharge: Fast"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P2614568357" "DoT(Smash), Immobilize, -Fly"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P2051563830" "You are being Crushed.  You cannot move or fly."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P108278574" "You increase the gravity around {PlayerDest} and Crush them for {Damage} points of smashing damage."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P3604253506" "{PlayerSource} increases the gravity around you and Crushes you for {Damage} points of smashing damage."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Lift 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3545215282" "Lift"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1743173185" "Ranged, Moderate DMG(Smash)"
// Power Help Text :
"P2496606818" "Negates the gravity around a single target. Lift violently sends an enemy straight into the air, then slams them to the ground for Smashing damage. This power can bring flying foes to the ground. Damage: Moderate, Recharge: Moderate"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P3107724139" "You drop {PlayerDest} to the ground for {Damage} points of smashing damage!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P3443579566" "{PlayerSource} lifts you and drops you to the ground for {Damage} points of smashing damage!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
