"P1003436427" "DoT(Cold), Immobilize, -SPD, -Recharge"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P2464336953" "The Chilblain is causing damage over time to you, and is holding you immobile.  Your Attack rate and Running speed are also reduced."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Block of Ice 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3118204850" "Block of Ice"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2732056965" "Ranged, Moderate DMG(Cold), Foe Hold, -SPD, -Recharge"
// Power Help Text :
"P1375030455" "You can freeze a single foe in a Block of Ice. The target is frozen solid, helpless, and can be attacked. More powerful foes may not be held, but all affected targets will be Slowed and take some Cold damage. Damage: Moderate, Recharge: Moderate"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P2491454990" "You freeze {PlayerDest} for {Damage} points of cold damage!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P1953486956" "{PlayerSource} freeze you for {Damage} points of Cold damage."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Frostbite 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P4182514592" "Frostbite"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P529425902" "Ranged (Targeted AoE), Minor DoT(Cold), Foe Immobilize, -SPD, -Recharge"
// Power Help Text :
"P4260003263" "Immobilizes a group of foes in icy traps. Deals minimal Cold damage over time and slightly Slows the targets. Slower and less damaging than Chilblain, but can capture multiple targets. More resilient foes may only be Slowed. Damage: Minor(DoT), Recharge: Moderate"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P2071838229" "The Frostbite is causing damage over time to you, and is holding you immobile.  Your Attack rate and Running speed are also reduced."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Artic Air 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P550725603" "Arctic Air"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3441487566" "Toggle: PBAoE, Foe Confuse(Special), -SPD, -Recharge, -Stealth"
// Power Help Text :
"P2519573236" "While this power is active, you are surrounded in a fog of Arctic Air that dramatically slows the attack and movement speed of nearby foes.  The chill of Arctic Air is so bitter that many foes are forced to flee, albeit very slowly, from the immediate area. Others may attack their own allies, as the fog from the Arctic Air is thick and can cause much confusion.  The cold air can also reduced the stealth capability of affected foes. Recharge: Slow"
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P1914334972" "You surround yourself in bitter cold {PowerName}, causing {PlayerSource} to shiver!"
// Power VictimHit Message :
"P3253187687" "You shiver as the cold {PowerName} from {PlayerSource} hits you, your attack speed and movement rate have been reduced!"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P1153392305" "Confuse, -SPD, -Recharge, -Stealth"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P1027505645" "The Arctic Air has reduced your Running speed and Attack rate. The cold air has reduced your stealth capability and you are periodically confused, and may attack an incorrect target with your powers."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P671509159" "You terrify {PlayerDest} as the foggy {PowerName} surrounds them!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P3301664580" "{PlayerSource} terrifies you as the foggy {PowerName} surrounds you!"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P2398668358" "You confuse {PlayerDest} with the clouds from your {PowerName}!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P3154190751" "{PlayerSource} confuses you with the clouds from their {PowerName}!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Shiver 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P1701944223" "Your {PowerName} dramatically Slow the attack speed and movement of {PlayerDest}"
// Power VictimHit Message :
"P3646837205" "{PlayerSource} Slows you with their {PowerName}."
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P3117558399" "You are shivering.  Your attack rate and movement speed are reduced."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Ice Slick 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3381390693" "Ice Slick"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3469263350" "Target (Location AoE), Foe Knockdown, -SPD"
// Power Help Text :
"P2991898505" "You can create a large patch of ice at a targeted area, causing all foes that pass through it to lose their footing. Those caught in the Ice Slick are dramatically slowed, tend to fall down and will be unable to jump. Recharge: Slow"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P902485759" "The Ice Slick has reduced your Running speed."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P4026445528" "You freeze the ground into an {PowerName}!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Flash Freeze 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P889361091" "Flash Freeze"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1242338930" "Ranged (Targeted AoE), Minor DMG(Cold/Lethal), Foe Sleep"
// Power Help Text :
"P574642158" "You can Flash Freeze a large patch of ground beneath a targeted foe, instantly forming dozens of deadly ice shards that do Cold damage to all enemies in the area. The victims are left trapped within the icicles, but can break free if disturbed. Only targets near the ground can be affected. Damage: Minor, Recharge: Slow"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P1543480825" "You have been frozen and cannot act."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P1059044119" "Your {PowerName} deals {Damage} points of lethal damage to {PlayerDest}."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P2221891402" "Your {PowerName} deals {Damage} points of cold damage to {PlayerDest}."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P667221853" "Your sleep effect on {PlayerDest} with your {PowerName} was even more powerful!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P2231003957" "{PlayerSource} lands an extra strong sleep effect on you with their {PowerName}!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Glacier 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P263201509" "Glacier"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1181465507" "PBAoE, Foe Hold, -Recharge, -SPD"
// Power Help Text :
"P4181586144" "You can freeze all foes around yourself in blocks of Glacial ice. The targets are frozen solid, helpless, and can be attacked. Even after the victims emerge, they remain chilled and their attack and movement speed is Slowed for a while. This power can only be cast near the ground. Recharge: Very Long"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P2891143059" "You are frozen in a Glacier.  Once free, your Attack Rate and Running speed will be reduced slightly for a while."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Jack Frost 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P4144432762" "Jack Frost"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P631689004" "Summon Jack Frost: Melee Moderate DMG(Cold)"
// Power Help Text :
"P2679818814" "You can create a very powerful entity of animated ice at a targeted location. Jack Frost possesses several ice powers to attack any nearby foes and can be healed and buffed like any teammate. Type ''/release_pets'' in the chat window to release all your pets. Recharge: Very Long"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P1712748702" "{PowerName} forms out of thin air at your command!"

// ******************************************************************************** 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Set : Illusion Control 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayName :
"P2482690152" "Illusion Control"
// DisplayHelp :
"P2124033242" "You can manipulate light and sound to manifest all sorts of Illusions, aiding your allies as well as deceiving your foes."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Spectral Wounds 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2368889973" "Spectral Wounds"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2461111634" "Ranged, High DMG(Psionic), +Special"
// Power Help Text :
"P4084769341" "Spectral Wounds convinces the target that they have taken severe damage. The illusion is so convincing that the victim can fall from the Spectral Wounds. However, the damage is not real, and if the victim survives long enough, the illusion will fade and some of the wounds will heal. Damage: High(Illusionary), Recharge: Moderate"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P2300646149" "Your {PowerName} convinces {PlayerDest} that they took {Damage} points of damage."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P1106131905" "The illusion of your {PowerName} has faded and the wounds have faded."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Blind 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1665574728" "Blind"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1662844480" "Ranged (Targeted AoE), Moderate DMG(Psionic), Foe Hold/Sleep"
// Power Help Text :
"P3094520607" "Painfully Blinds a single targeted foe so severely that they are rendered helpless. Blind is so bright that additional foes may also be blinded, though they will not take any damage, and attacking them will free them from the effects. Damage: Moderate, Recharge: Moderate"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P3463939617" "Hold, Sleep"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P129131925" "You have been Blinded."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P2010763324" "You Blind {PlayerDest} for {Damage} points of Psionic damage!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P2583092446" "{PlayerSource} Blinds you for {Damage} points of Energy damage."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Deceive 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2764087641" "Deceive"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P4115063526" "Ranged, Foe Confuse"
// Power Help Text :
"P1519678874" "You can Deceive an enemy into believing their friends are not who they appear to be. If successful, the enemy will ignore you and attack their own allies. If you Deceive someone before they have noticed you, your presence will continue to be masked. You will not receive any Experience Points for foes defeated by a Deceived enemy. Recharge: Moderate"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P3246574055" "You have been confused.  You may attack an incorrect target."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P2848211071" "You confuse {PlayerDest}!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P1011784172" "{PlayerSource} confuses you!"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P639843269" "You confuse {PlayerDest} even more!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P3406839748" "{PlayerSource} confuses you even more!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Flash 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1846505479" "Flash"
// Power Help Text :
"P1761396185" "Generates a brilliant flash of light around you that blinds nearby foes. Flashed foes are rendered helpless and unable to defend themselves. Recharge: Very Long"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Group Invisibility 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1245546238" "Group Invisibility"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P4270190323" "PBAoE, Team Stealth, +DEF(All)"
// Power Help Text :
"P572103610" "Makes you and all teammates around you Invisible. While Invisible, you and your teammates are almost impossible to detect. Even if discovered, Group Invisibility grants a bonus to your Defense to all attacks, although you will lose some of your defense bonus if you attack. Group Invisibility has no movement penalty. Recharge: Slow"
// Power VictimHit Message :
"P4071210598" "{PlayerSource} makes you invisible!"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P3665457053" "Invisible, +DEF(All)"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P3770865509" "You have been made Invisible and are difficult to detect.  Your Defense is increased as a result."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Phantom Army 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2854556052" "Phantom Army"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2044656699" "Summon Decoys: Ranged Minor DMG(Energy/Special)"
// Power Help Text :
"P2106256602" "You can fabricate 3 Phantom heroes around a targeted foe. These Phantoms are not real, and are indestructible. Their attacks are similar to Spectral Wounds. Though they deal damage, it is illusory and will heal if the victim survives long enough. Phantoms are short lived and cannot be buffed or healed. Recharge: Very Long"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P998401764" "You create a {PowerName} of pure illusion!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Spectral Terror 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1561232778" "Spectral Terror"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P4194083598" "Summon Terror: Ranged Fear"
// Power Help Text :
"P3700068927" "You can create an illusion of unspeakable Terror. The manifestation is so horrible that it caused most foes to tremble helplessly in terror. The Spectral Terror may also Terrify individual foes, causing them to run away in panic. Recharge: Slow"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P4271146106" "You are terrified."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P703765092" "You create a {PowerName}!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Phantasm 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P4155415282" "Phantasm"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P99581290" "Summon Phantasm: Ranged Moderate DAM (Energy)"
// Power Help Text :
"P3030649163" "You can construct a powerful entity composed of pure light. Although made of light, the Phantasm is tangible and has powerful Energy attacks. The Phantasm can also fly and summon duplicates of itself. The duplicates are intangible, and cannot be harmed. The duplicates' attacks deal illusory damage similar to that dealt by Spectral Wounds. Only the original Phantasm can be healed and buffed. Type ''/release_pets'' in the chat window to release all your pets. Recharge: Very Long"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P4146085904" "You construct a {PowerName} of pure light!"

// ******************************************************************************** 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Set : Mind Control 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayName :
"P1985844312" "Mind Control"
// DisplayHelp :
"P3661840123" "You can manipulate and control your opponent's mind. Since Mental powers directly affect the mind, most tend to be very accurate, and thus very useful against higher level foes. Few foes can resist Psionic powers, but creatures without minds, like machines and robots, are resistant to many of the effects."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Mesmerize 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P132115517" "Mesmerize"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3745657044" "Ranged, Moderate DMG(Psionic), Foe Sleep"
// Power Help Text :
"P2163445800" "Mesmerize painfully assails a target with psychic energy, rendering them unconscious. The target will remain asleep for some time, but will awaken if attacked. Damage: Moderate, Recharge: Moderate"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P2909147384" "You have been Mesmerized and cannot act."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P101038887" "{PlayerDest} is put to sleep by your {PowerName}!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P4201202719" "{Playersource} puts you to sleep with their {PowerName}!"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P1271393123" "Your {PowerName} enraptures {PlayerDest} for {Damage} points of Psionic damage!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P1565512527" "{PlayerSource} enraptures you for {Damage} points of Psionic damage with their {PowerName}."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Levitate 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1342451600" "Levitate"
// Power Help Text :
"P2442562156" "You can send a single target violently into the air, then slam them to the ground for Smashing damage. This power can bring flying foes to the ground. Damage: Moderate, Recharge: Moderate"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P3352584451" "You {PowerName} {PlayerDest} and drop them to the ground for {Damage} points of smashing damage!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Dominate 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1898196680" "Dominate"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P237929186" "Ranged, Moderate DMG(Psionic), Foe Hold"
// Power Help Text :
"P2825085718" "Painfully tears at the mind of a single foe. Dominate deals Psionic damage and renders a foe helpless, lost in their own mind and unable to defend themselves. Damage: Moderate, Recharge: Moderate"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P2697171271" "You have been Dominated."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P3628030904" "You Dominate {PlayerDest} for {Damage} points of Psionic damage!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P310874651" "{PlayerSource} Dominates you for {Damage} points of Psionic damage."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Confuse 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3576454646" "Ranged, Target Confuse"
// Power Help Text :
"P981395569" "You can Confuse an enemy, forcing that foe to believe their friends are not who they appear to be. If successful, the enemy will ignore you and attack their own allies. If you Confuse someone before they have noticed you, your presence will continue to be masked. You will not receive any Experience Points for foes defeated by a Confused enemy. Recharge: Moderate"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P2584848323" "You have been confused and may attack an incorrect target."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Mass Hypnosis 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1476679299" "Mass Hypnosis"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3125035697" "Ranged (Targeted AoE), Foe Sleep"
// Power Help Text :
"P1818379305" "Hypnotizes a group of foes at a distance and puts them to Sleep. The targets will remain asleep for some time, but will awaken if attacked. This power deals no damage, but if done discreetly, the targets will never be aware of your presence. Recharge: Slow"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P2694554816" "You have been Hypnotized and cannot act."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Total Domination 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1372864868" "Total Domination"
// Power Help Text :
"P2396344488" "Tears at the mind of a target foe and those near them. Dominate renders all affected foes helpless, lost in their own minds and unable to defend themselves. Recharge: Very Long"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Terrify 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P227779229" "Terrify"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2936611653" "Ranged (Cone), Minor DMG(Psionic), Foe Fear(Special)"
// Power Help Text :
"P831219536" "This power Terrifies foes within a cone area in front of you, causing them to tremble in Fear uncontrollably. The affect is so frightening and overwhelming, that the target takes real damage from the physiological response to this Psionic attack. Damage: Minor, Recharge: Slow"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P2416579000" "You have been terrified."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P948391865" "{PlayerDest} is Terrified and takes {Damage} points of Psionic damage."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P35236857" "{PlayerSource} Terrifies you.  Your fear consumes you for {Damage} points of Psionic damage."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P482192733" "You {PowerName} {PlayerDest} even more!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P4199523266" "{PlayerSource} terrifies you even more!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Mass Confusion 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P603284719" "Mass Confusion"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2684033640" "Ranged (Targeted AoE), Foe Confuse"
// Power Help Text :
"P1866824923" "You can cause Mass Confusion within a group of foes, creating chaos. All affected foes within the area will turn and attack each other, ignoring all heroes. If you Confuse villains before they noticed you, your presence will continue to go unnoticed. You will not receive any Experience Points for foes defeated by Confused enemies. Recharge: Very Long"

// ******************************************************************************** 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Set : Plant Control 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayName :
"P2665551719" "Plant Control"
// DisplayHelp :
"P2200191133" "You can call forth and control the power of plants and flora to control your foes. Animate and control vines, roots and spores to entrap, entwine and utterly dominate your foes.  Many Plant Control powers are only effective if the target is near the ground."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Entangle 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2311510427" "Entangle"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1977928016" "Ranged, Moderate DoT(Smashing, Lethal), Foe Immobilize"
// Power Help Text :
"P758686855" "Immobilizes your target by Entangling their feet in a twisted mass of thorny roots.  The roots do smashing and lethal damage to the target over time. More resilient foes may require multiple applications to Immobilize. Entangle can immobilize flying targets, if they are near the ground when attacked. Damage: Moderate(DoT), Recharge: Fast"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P96007827" "Immobilize, DoT(Smashing, Lethal), -Fly"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P1307118483" "The roots have Entangled you, crushing and cutting you. You are immobile and cannot fly."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P1017785955" "Your roots Entangle and crush {PlayerDest} for {Damage} points of smashing damage."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P3255310503" "{PlayerSource} Entangles you for {Damage} points of smashing damage!"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P1473990395" "Thorns from your roots Entangle and cut {PlayerDest} for {Damage} points of lethal damage."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P853782236" "Thorns from the roots cut you for {Damage} points of lethal damage!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Strangler 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1512853674" "Strangler"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3361538192" "Ranged, Moderate DoT(Smashing), Foe Hold"
// Power Help Text :
"P1006510016" "Holds a distant foe by Strangling them with massive root-like vines. The target is held helpless, while they is slowly crushed by the vines. Damage: Moderate(DoT), Recharge: Moderate"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P1388205829" "Hold, DoT(Smashing)"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P1317566367" "The Strangler Vine is crushing you and preventing you from acting."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P3798610094" "Your Strangler Vines crush {PlayerDest} for {Damage} points of smashing damage."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P2383523282" "{PlayerSource} crushes you with Strangler Vines for {Damage} points of smashing damage!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Roots 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P643865738" "Roots"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1693257692" "Ranged (Targeted AoE), Minor DoT(Smashing, Lethal), Foe Immobilize"
// Power Help Text :
"P2077874222" "Immobilizes a group of foes by entangling their feet in a twisted mass of thorny Roots.  Roots is slower and does less damage than Entangle, but it can capture multiple foes in one attack. Like Entangle, Roots can immobilize flying targets, if they are near the ground when attacked. Damage: Minor(DoT), Recharge: Fast"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P3912708265" "The Roots have entangled you. You are immobile and cannot fly."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P2050263094" "Your roots entangle and crush {PlayerDest} for {Damage} points of smashing damage."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P3511610119" "{PlayerSource} Roots you for {Damage} points of smashing damage!"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P4199272026" "Your Roots entangle and cut {PlayerDest} for {Damage} points of lethal damage."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P1781923097" "The roots cut you for {Damage} points of lethal damage!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Spore Burst 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3049408788" "Spore Burst"
// Power Help Text :
"P2927513793" "You hurl a large fungi pod at your foes.  This pod is full of Spores that burst on impact, engulfing the target and all those around them.  All affected targets may succumb to the narcotic effect of the Spores and will fall asleep. The targets will remain asleep for some time, but will awaken if attacked. Recharge: Slow"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P3852064002" "The Spore Burst has rendered you unconscious!  Any damage will awaken you, however."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Seeds of Confusion 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P822704386" "Seeds of Confusion"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P233247000" "Ranged (Cone), Foe Confuse"
// Power Help Text :
"P2412309615" "You throw a handful of seeds from a rare Baffle plant at your foes.  The seeds spread out in a wide cone and release a dusty chaff that contain a number of alkaloids and hallucinogenic compounds.  Foes that come into contact with these seeds become violently confused and will turn and attack each other, ignoring you and all your allies. You will not receive any Experience Points for foes defeated entirely by Confused enemies. Recharge: Very Long"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Spirit Tree 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P456354136" "Spirit Tree"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1999456239" "Place Tree: PBAoE +Regen"
// Power Help Text :
"P3540830848" "You can tap into the elusive and powerful energy of the World Tree and extract a Spirit Tree at a targeted location. The Sprit Tree is immobile, but possesses incredible regenerative powers. The Regeneration Rate of you, or your allies, will be greatly increased as long as you are near the Spirit Tree.  Recharge: Very Long"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P1734497484" "A {PowerName} springs from the ground!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Vines 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2760912049" "Vines"
// Power Help Text :
"P267223508" "Creates a field of Strangler Vines that can Hold multiple foes at range. The affected targets are held helpless by the massive root-like vines. Unlike the power Strangler, this power does not deal any damage, but it can Hold multiple foes at once. Recharge: Very Long"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P1778180013" "The Vines are Holding you and preventing you from acting."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Carrion Creepers 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3728825099" "Carrion Creepers"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1677778155" "Summon Creepers, Ranged (Location AoE), Target -Speed, -Fly, -Jump,"
// Power Help Text :
"P2565561919" "You can create a Creeper patch at a targeted location.  The patch will snag foes, slowing their movement, and preventing them from jumping or flying. Additionally, a Creeper Vine will burst from under each live and defeated foe in the area and start attacking your enemies. Creeper Vines do minimal damage, but they can knock down your enemies and its poisonous thorns can slow your foes. Any foes that are defeated in the Creeper patch will also produce a growth of Entangle Roots that will Immobilize any enemies near the defeated foe. Recharge: Very Long"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Fly Trap 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P349392526" "Fly Trap"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3041632272" "Summon Fly Trap: Ranged Control Special"
// Power Help Text :
"P785516111" "You can summon a giant carnivorous Fly Trap plant beast.  Fly Trap may be an understatement, as this plant beast has a taste for flesh.  The Fly Trap will viciously attack any nearby foes; biting, hurling poisonous Thorns and even casting its own Entangle Roots. The Fly Trap will fight by your side and can be healed and buffed like any teammate. Recharge: Very Long"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P1721012894" "A giant {PowerName} springs from the ground and begins to follow you!"

// ******************************************************************************** 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Set : Pain Domination 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayName :
"P3134386314" "Pain Domination"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Nullify Pain 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P175982904" "Nullify Pain"
// Power Help Text :
"P2671953981" "Nullify Pain will heal nearby allies for some hit points by numbing the pain caused by their wounds. Nullify Pain is not as potent as Soothe, but can heal multiple targets at once. Recharge: Moderate"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P3262186852" "You nullify some of {PlayerDest}'s pain and heal them for {Damage} points of health."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P1319995399" "{PlayerSource} nullifies some of your pain to heal you for {Damage} points of health."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Soothe 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2163960007" "Soothe"
// Power Help Text :
"P3872587599" "You heal an ally by numbing their pain and calming their mind. You cannot use this power on yourself."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Enforced Morale 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1482189927" "Enforced Morale"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1475859199" "Ally +Res(Disorient, Hold, Sleep, Immobilize, Fear, Confuse), +Perception, +Recharge, +Speed, Minor Damage"
// Power Help Text :
"P1081314404" "Enforced Morale frees an ally from any Disorient, Hold, Sleep, Fear, Confuse and Immobilize effects and leaves them resistant to such effects for a good while. Also, Enforced Morale grants the target clearer Perception to see hidden foes, and a minor recharge and movement speed boost. The Protection and Movement boosts will improve with multiple applications and as you advance in level, although the Recharge and Movement boosts will only apply for the first few applications. If the ally is not damaged, Enforced Morale will cause them some pain before granting its benefits. Recharge: Fast"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P1046625860" "+Res(Disorient, Hold, Sleep, Immobilize, Fear, Confuse), +Perception, +Recharge, +Movement"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Soothing Aura 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2901723507" "Soothing Aura"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P658702312" "Toggle: PBAoE, Team Minor Periodic Heal"
// Power Help Text :
"P538965005" "While this power is active all nearby allies will be healed by Soothing Aura every couple of seconds for a small portion of their health.  (NOTE: While on PvP maps this power will grant affected targets a regeneration effect instead of a periodic heal.)"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P3481954157" "+Periodic Heal"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P1800862508" "You are standing within a Soothing Aura, you will periodically recovery health."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P1525851397" "Your {PowerName} heals {PlayerDest} for {Damage} points of health."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P3994074195" "{PlayerSource} heals you fo {Damage} points of health with their {PowerName}!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : World of Pain 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1251538091" "World of Pain"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1972376190" "PBAoE Team +To-Hit, +DMG, +RES(All DMG, Placate)"
// Power Help Text :
"P1379151662" "When this power is activated the user and all nearby team members will gain a moderate damage, resistance, and to-hit bonus. Additionally those affected by this power will also be protected from Placate effects."
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P1535041317" "Your {PowerName} increases your team's chance to hit, damage resistance, Placate protection and damage output."
// Power VictimHit Message :
"P2486205930" "{PlayerSource} increases your team's chance to hit, damage resistance, Placate protection and damage output with their {PowerName}!"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P1788780421" "+To-Hit, +DMG, +RES(All DMG, Placate)"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P2601060428" "Your chance to hit, damage resistance, damage output is increased.  Additionally your resistance to Placate is increased."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Anguishing Cry 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P747186998" "Anguishing Cry"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2417726038" "PBAoE, Foe -RES(All), -DEF(All)"
// Power Help Text :
"P2543905602" "You let out an Anguishing Cry causing a great deal of pain in your foes reducing their resistance and defense to damage for a short time."
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P3615526159" "You let out an {PowerName} reducing the defense and resistance of {PlayerDest}!"
// Power VictimHit Message :
"P2170765780" "The harsh sound of {PlayerSource}'s {PowerName} rings in your ears reducing your resistance and defense!"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P2811264289" "-DEF, -RES(All)"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P3000401342" "Your resistance and defense has been reduced by the Anguishing Cry."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Painbringer 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3871125677" "Painbringer"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1103158224" "Ally, +Regeneration, +Recovery, +DMG"
// Power Help Text :
"P3209306633" "You transform an ally to pain incarnate turning them into an inexhaustible killing machine. While the character is imbued with this power they will benefit from incredible health regeneration, endurance recovery and improved damage potential for a short time."
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P3378529597" "You empower {PlayerDest} with dramatically increased Endurance Recovery, Hit Point Regeneration and damage output"
// Power VictimHit Message :
"P2474556352" "{PlayerSource} empowers you with dramatically increased Endurance Recovery, Hit Point Regeneration and damage output."
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P2447182674" "+Regeneration, +Recovery, +DMG"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P1854576963" "You have been inspired to inflict a great deal of pain.  Your regeneration, recovery and damage have been greatly increased!"

