// ******************************************************************************** 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Set : Staff Fighting 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayName :
"P1671348127" "Staff Fighting"
// DisplayHelp :
"P3506264074" "You have mastered the art of staff fighting, allowing you to strike at your foes in great sweeping arcs.  Staff Fighting provides a good amount of control effects as well as some self buffs.  By selecting the Staff Mastery power, you will gain access to techniques that further empower your Staff Fighting techniques and grant you useful augmentations that build up as you fight."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Mercurial Blow 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P4212191260" "Mercurial Blow"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P974119330" "Melee, Light DMG(Smash), Foe -Def"
// Power Help Text :
"P4091448698" "You strike your foe with a lightning fast blow from  your staff dealing Light Smashing damage.  The attack is so unexpected  that the target's defenses are reduced slightly for a short time.  While a form is active, this power will build one level of Perfection.    Damage: Light, Recharge: Fast"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P3100956268" "-Def"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P3627445229" "Your defense has been reduced by Mercurial Blow."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P1893956116" "You strike {PlayerDest} with your {PowerName} for {Damage} points of smashing damage and reduce their defense."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P3682586936" "{PlayerSource} strikes you with their {PowerName} for {Damage} points of smashing damage and reduces your defense!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Precise Strike 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1562137608" "Precise Strike"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2562606845" "Melee, Moderate DMG(Smash), Foe Disorient"
// Power Help Text :
"P1810409765" "You attempt to daze your foe with a heavy staff blow  to their head.  Precise Strike has a higher chance to hit than normal,  deals Moderate Smashing damage, and has a small chance to disorient the  target briefly.   While a form is active, this power will build one level of Perfection.  Damage: Moderate, Recharge: Fast."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P703164344" "You strike {PlayerDest} with your {PowerName} for {Damage} points of smashing damage."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P4237552787" "{PlayerSource} strikes you with their {PowerName} for {Damage} points of smashing damage!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Serpents Reach 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3729913855" "Serpent's Reach"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1249122484" "Ranged, Moderate Dmg(Smash), Foe Knockdown"
// Power Help Text :
"P1856959131" "You fully extend your staff and release a burst of energy to lash out at a distant target and deal High Smashing damage with a good chance to knock your target down.  While a form is active, this power will build one level of Perfection.  Damage: High, Recharge: Long"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Guarded Spin 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P484186458" "Guarded Spin"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P280558684" "Melee (Cone), Moderate DMG (Smash), Self +Def(Melee, Lethal)"
// Power Help Text :
"P3004588675" "You spin your staff like a propeller in front of you  dealing Light Smashing damage to enemies in your frontal arc and deflecting any incoming attacks, thus boosting your Melee and Lethal damage briefly.   While a form is active, this power will build one level of Perfection.  Damage: Moderate, Recharge: Moderate"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P2646575536" "+Def"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P3381731766" "Your Guarded Spin has increased your defense moderately."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P4218192560" "Your {PowerName} hits {PlayerDest} for {Damage} points of smashing damage and boosts your own defense!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P3090404567" "{PlayerSource} hits you with their {PowerName} for {Damage} points of smashing damage and bolsters their own defense!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Build Up 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Eye of the Storm 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1480912102" "Eye of the Storm"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3417303276" "PBAoE Melee, Moderate DMG(Smash), Foe Knockdown, Consumes Perfection"
// Power Help Text :
"P3255754516" "With a lightning fast series of spins of your staff you strike at all nearby foes dealing moderate damage with a chance of knocking foes down.  While a form is active, this power will build one level of Perfection if the user has two or less levels, if the user has three levels of Perfection it will consume them and gain some benefit.  3 Levels of Perfection of Body will cause additional smashing damage and reduce damage resistance slightly for a short time.  3 Levels of Perfection of Mind will cause additional psionic damage and reduce attack and movement speed for a short time.  3 Levels of Perfection of Soul will cause additional energy damage and reduce defense for a short time.  Critical Hit damage isn't enhanced by levels of Perfection.  Damage: Moderate, Recharge: Long"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P68898796" "Eye of the Storm has been empowered by the user's Perfection levels causing it to have lingering effects."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P45509802" "Your {PowerName} strikes {PlayerDest} for {Damage} points of smashing damage!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P292151044" "{PlayerSource} strikes you for {Damage} points of smashing damage!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Innocuous Strikes 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2812989599" "Innocuous Strikes"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3554280595" "Melee Cone, High DMG(Smash), Foe Immobilize, -Speed"
// Power Help Text :
"P1913906050" "You repeatedly batter your foes' feet and legs with a flurry of sweeps of your staff.  This attack deals Moderate Smashing damage to all foes within its cone.  All affected targets will have their movement speed reduced, with a chance of being immobilized briefly.  While a form is active, this power will build one level of Perfection. Damage: High, Recharge: Long"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P37065124" "-Speed"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P1186580731" "Your movement speed has been reduced!"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P1733911188" "Your {PowerName} hits {PlayerDest} for {Damage} points of smashing damage and slows their movement speed."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P4059117771" "{PlayerSource} hits you with their {PowerName} for {Damage} points of smashing damage and slows your movement speed!"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P2541951899" "You attempt to immobilize {PlayerDest} with your {PowerName}."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P1813956810" "{PlayerSource} attempts to immobilizes you with their {PowerName}."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Sky Splitter 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P110753208" "Sky Splitter"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2632771366" "Melee, Extreme DMG(Smash), Foe Knockdown, Disorient, Consumes Perfection"
// Power Help Text :
"P471529712" "You leap into the air and hammer your foe with an overhead bash from your staff.  Sky Splitter deals Extreme Smashing damage, will knock the target off their feet and leave them held briefly.  While a form is active, this power will build one level of Perfection if the user has two or less levels, if the user has three levels of Perfection it will consume them and gain some benefit.  3 Levels of Perfection of Body will cause additional smashing damage and grant the user a bonus to damage resistance a short time.  3 Levels of Perfection of Mind will cause additional psionic damage and boost the user's chance to hit for a short time.  3 Levels of Perfection of Soul will cause additional energy damage and increase the user's regeneration and recovery rate briefly.  Critical Hit damage isn't enhanced by levels of Perfection.  Damage: Extreme, Recharge: Slow"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P1767117015" "You decimate {PlayerDest} with your {PowerName} for {Damage} points of smashing damage."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P79296238" "{PlayerSource} decimates you with their {PowerName} for {Damage} points of smashing damage."

// ******************************************************************************** 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Set : Titan Weapons 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayName :
"P1852466848" "Titan Weapons"
// DisplayHelp :
"P126363283" "You wield an over-sized weapon of some sort; a gigantic sword, mace or axe or possibly even a railroad crossing sign. The weapon's sheer mass gives it great destructive power, and your immense strength and skill allow you to use it as a devastating weapon. Titan Weapons as a set, has exceptional area of effect capability, while retaining a strong single target ability. Certain powers can only be used as follow up attacks and are grayed out when first entering combat, while others allow you to build up momentum and accelerate your attack speed for a few moments."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Defensive Sweep 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1426350644" "Defensive Sweep"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2042335827" "Melee (Cone), Light DMG(Smashing), Self +DEF"
// Power Help Text :
"P3125403881" "You take a defensive stance and strike your opponent.  Successfully executing this attack will cause light smashing damage to your opponent, while giving you increased defense against their melee attacks.  Damage: Light, Recharge: Fast"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P2721162609" "Your Defense has been increased by your Defensive Sweep."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P3007055125" "Your {PowerName} hits {PlayerDest} for {Damage} points of smashing damage and increases your Defense to melee and smashing attacks!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Crushing Blow 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P775678673" "Crushing Blow"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P833100540" "Melee, High DMG(Smashing)"
// Power Help Text :
"P452225338" "You swing a mighty crushing blow at your opponent dealing High Smashing damage.  Damage: High, Recharge: Moderate"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Throwing Knives 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Follow Through 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2466830066" "Follow Through"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3456552698" "Melee, Superior DMG(Smashing), Foe Minor DoT(Lethal), Knockdown, Stun, Requires Momentum"
// Power Help Text :
"P414355177" "You Follow Through with a massive attack dealing Superior Smashing damage, knocking your opponent down and possibly stunning them.  Additionally, Follow Through can cause the target to suffer a small amount of Lethal damage over time.  NOTE: Follow Through requires Momentum in order to be activated.  Damage: Superior, Recharge: Long"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P1066116238" "Disoriented"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P3968446753" "You are disoriented."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P3163970743" "Your {PowerName} causes {PlayerDest} to bleed for {Damage} points of Lethal damage!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P2399989603" "You continue to bleed from {PlayerSource}'s {PowerName} for {Damage} points of Lethal damage!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Build Up 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Sweeping Strike 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2455120661" "Melee (Cone), High DMG(Smashing), Foe Knockdown"
// Power Help Text :
"P3920549092" "You make a sweeping slash with your weapon, causing high damage and possibly knocking your opponent down. Damage: High, Recharge: Long"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Shatter Armor 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P172602630" "Shatter Armor"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1053380827" "Melee, Extreme DMG(Smashing), Foe -Def(All), -Res(All)"
// Power Help Text :
"P500999592" "You batter your enemy with your mighty weapon dealing Extreme Smashing damage and reducing their resistance to damage as well as their defense to all types of attacks for a short time. Damage: Extreme, Recharge: Long"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P1870741899" "-DEF, -Res(All)"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P3101919881" "You are bruised and dazed, which reduces your damage resistance and defense."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Whirling Smash 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3681436250" "Whirling Smash"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3363089864" "PBAoE Melee, Moderate DMG(Smashing), Foe Minor DoT(Lethal), Knockdown, Requires Momentum"
// Power Help Text :
"P333746249" "You perform a powerful Whirling Smash that deals Moderate Smashing damage, and can knock an opponent down.  Additionally, Whirling Smash can cause the target to suffer a small amount of Lethal damage over time.  NOTE: Whirling Smash requires Momentum in order to be activated.  Damage: Moderate, Recharge: Slow"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P3355203593" "You strike {PlayerDest} for {Damage} points of Smashing damage and reduce his Defense!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P3178276733" "{PlayerSource} tag you for {Damage} points of Smashing damage and reduces your defense!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Arc of Destruction 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3552304298" "Arc of Destruction"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3611358446" "Melee (Cone), Superior DMG(Smashing), Foe Knockback"
// Power Help Text :
"P1514758185" "You swing your weapon in a devastating Arc of Destruction that deals Superior Smashing damage and has a good chance to knock foes down.  Damage: Superior, Recharge: Slow"

