// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Set : Darkness Control 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayName :
"P2110165294" "Darkness Control"
// DisplayHelp :
"P1301364827" "You can control darkness and shadow to disable your foes with negative energy.  Enemies that are affected by many of your attacks will have their chance to hit reduced."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Shadowy Binds 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1776711588" "Shadowy Binds"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3017900070" "Ranged, Moderate DoT(Negative), Foe Immobilize, -To Hit, -Fly"
// Power Help Text :
"P111201724" "You take control of your victim's shadow causing it to entangle and bind its owner thus leaving them immobilized and suffering from negative energy damage over time and reducing their chance to hit.  Immobilized foes cannot move but can still attack. Damage: Moderate, Recharge: Fast"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P1495139328" "You have been entangled by Shadowy Binds and have been left immobilized."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P3913018392" "You entangle {PlayerDest} with your {PowerName} for {Damage} points of negative energy damage and reduce their chance to hit!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P4225483368" "{PlayerSource} entangles you with their {PowerName} for {Damage} points of negative energy damage and reduces your chance to hit!"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
// Effect VictimHit Message :
// DisplayFloat :

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Dark Grasp 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1766639583" "Dark Grasp"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P734849811" "Ranged, Moderate DMG(Negative), Foe Hold, -To Hit"
// Power Help Text :
"P3378054260" "You cause your target's shadow to wholly envelop them, leaving them held and rendered helpless while suffering from moderate negative energy damage. Even if the target is powerful enough to resist the power's hold effect they will have their chance to hit reduced. Damage: Moderate, Recharge: Moderate"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P2998313093" "Hold, -To Hit"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P693586527" "The Penumbral Grasp has stopped you in your tracks!"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P2841660671" "You hold {PlayerDest} with your {PowerName} and reduce their chance to hit!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P3609240155" "{PlayerSource} holds you with their {PowerName} and reduces your chance to hit!"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
// Effect VictimHit Message :
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P259212171" "You envelop {PlayerDest} within your {PowerName} for {Damage} points of negative energy damage and reduce their chance to hit!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P3748865374" "{PlayerSource} envelops you with their {PowerName} for {Damage} points of additional negative energy damage and reduce their chance to hit!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Living Shadows 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3511745250" "Living Shadows"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P420247998" "Ranged (Cone), Minor DoT(Negative), Foe Immobilize, -To Hit, -Fly"
// Power Help Text :
"P1058106044" "You extend and animate your own shadow causing it to entangle all foes within a long cone pattern in front of you, rendering all affected foes immobilized. Damage: Minor(DoT), Recharge: Moderate"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P1111096912" "The Living Shadows are holding you immobile and reducing your chance to hit."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Possess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P65084755" "Possess"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
// Power Help Text :
"P2321404718" "You cause your targeted foe to be possessed by a dark entity from the Netherworld causing them to be confused for a short period of time. While confused they will be unable to tell the difference between friend or foe and will attack nearby allies. Recharge: Moderate"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
// DisplayTargetHelp :
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P3313720937" "You {PowerName} {PlayerDest} causing them to be confused!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P1026298651" "{PlayerSource} possesses and confuses you!"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P3114009974" "Your confuse on {PlayerDest} was more powerful than normal."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P3782431742" "{PlayerSource}'s confuse is more powerful than normal"

