// Effect VictimHit Message :
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P3613554856" "You terrify {PlayerDest} even more!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Heart of Darkness 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1322834365" "Heart of Darkness"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P860140975" "PBAoE, Foe Disorient, -To Hit, Minor DoT(Negative)"
// Power Help Text :
"P2027245598" "In a burst of negative energy you overwhelm the minds of those around you causing them to be disoriented and suffer minor negative energy damage over a short time.  Affected targets will also have their chance to hit reduced.  Damage: Minor (DoT), Recharge: Very Long"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P1503989119" "Your {PowerName} deals {Damage} points of negative energy damage to {PlayerDest}."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P229045373" "{PlayerSource} chills your very soul with their{PowerName} for {Damage} points of negative energy damage!"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
// Effect VictimHit Message :

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Haunt 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3541511492" "Haunt"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3340232153" "Foe Targeted, Summon Shades"
// Power Help Text :
"P2816566842" "You summon a pair of Shades from the Netherworld to harass your target foe.  Shades deal moderate damage and they terrorize their victims. Recharge: Very Long"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Shadow Field 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2654159565" "Shadow Field"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3834699233" "Target (Location AoE), Foe Hold, -To Hit"
// Power Help Text :
"P2819206322" "You blanket a targeted area in darkness. Any foe who enters this area will have their chance to hit reduced and has a chance to be held for a short period of time. Recharge: Slow"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P221108448" "You are rendered held by the Shadow Field."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P2251734711" "You create a Static Field nearby!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Umbra Beast 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3294494973" "Umbra Beast"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2653315905" "Summon Umbra Beast"
// Power Help Text :
"P3117143096" "You conjure up one of the most fearsome creatures of the Netherworld, the Umbra Beast. This creature will fight beside its summoner using its brutal claw, bite and darkness attacks. Recharge: Very Long"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P2987067974" "You conjure forth a fierce Umbra Beast from the Netherworld to aid you in battle."

