// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Total Focus 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Help Text :
"P3831234664" "Total Focus is complete mastery over Energy Melee. This melee attack is a very slow, but incredibly devastating attack that can knock out most opponents, leaving them Disoriented. Due to the exhausting nature of Total Focus, recharge time is very long. Damage: Extreme, Recharge: Long"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P785923856" "The devastation of your {PowerName} deals {Damage} points of smashing Damage to {PlayerDest}."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P1814594943" "{PlayerSource} devastates you with their {PowerName} for {Damage} points of smashing damage!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P1328194989" "{PlayerSource} devastates you with their {PowerName} for {Damage} points of energy damage!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
