// Display Name :
"P1111427260" "Sniper Blast"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2536488087" "Sniper, Extreme DMG(Energy/Smash), Foe Knockback"
// Power Help Text :
"P3006679074" "A focused blast that can travel great distances with high Accuracy. This is a sniper attack, and is best fired from a distance, as it can be interrupted. Damage: Superior, Recharge: Slow"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P2549588817" "Your {PowerName} pegs {PlayerDest} for {Damage} points of smashing damage."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P1845610995" "Your {PowerName} pegs {PlayerDest} for {Damage} points of energy damage."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Power Burst 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Help Text :
"P1616617736" "A short range, but devastating attack. Damage: High, Recharge: Slow"

