"P1335236228" "Fiery Assault"
// DisplayHelp :
"P2846008843" "Fiery Assault allows you to conjure up flaming melee attacks and hurl devastating fiery projectiles. Fiery Assault powers tend to set foes ablaze for added Damage Over Time."

