"P341049142" "Ice Slash"
// Power Help Text :
"P3630802032" "Ice Slash allows the user to create a blade of solid ice and strike a foe for high damage.  Being hit by Ice Slash will Slow a foes' attack and movement speed, due to the intense chill. Damage: High, Recharge: Slow"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
