"P788360112" "Skewer"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1058759904" "Melee, Moderate DMG(Lethal), DoT(Toxic) -DEF"
// Power Help Text :
"P4012426895" "You lunge forward with this melee attack and Skewer your foe with the large Thorn on your arm. Deals moderate damage and poisons your foe. Poison from the Thorns deals additional Toxic damage and can reduce your foes Defense. Damage: Moderate, Recharge: Fast"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P1414014564" "Your {PowerName} stabs {PlayerDest} for {Damage} points of lethal damage reducing their defense!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P1280637246" "{PlayerSource} stabs you with their {PowerName} for {Damage} points of lethal damage reducing your defense!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Fling Thorns 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1788509851" "Fling Thorns"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1887834338" "Ranged (Cone), Moderate DMG(Lethal), DoT(Toxic) -DEF"
// Power Help Text :
"P2265353391" "You can throw dozens of Thorns in a wide cone in front of you, impaling foes caught within the area. These Thorns deals moderate damage, and poisons any targets it hits. Thorn poison deals additional Toxic damage and can reduce your foes' Defense.  Damage: Moderate, Recharge: Slow"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P165488135" "Your {PowerName} strikes {PlayerDest} for {Damage} points of lethal damage and reduces their defense!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P1888046250" "{PlayerSource} strikes you with their {PowerName} for {Damage} points of lethal damage reducing your defense!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Impale 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2136070908" "Ranged, Moderate DMG(Lethal), DoT(Toxic), Immobilize, -DEF, -SPD, -Fly, -Jump"
// Power Help Text :
"P341731041" "You can throw a small cluster of large Thorns at a targeted foe. These Thorns carry a large amount of the toxin. In addition to dealing Toxic damage, a successful attack can slow a target, preventing Running, Jumping or Flying.  Most foes will likely be completely Immobilized, unable to run. Damage: Moderate, Recharge: Moderate"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P4214455106" "DoT(Toxic), Immobilize, -DEF, -SPD, -Fly, -Jump"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P716334542" "You are poisoned!  Your Running speed is reduced and you may be immobilized and unable to run, jump or fly."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P1003371170" "You Impale {PlayerDest} for {Damage} points of lethal damage, immobilizing them and reducing their defense!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P3741243318" "{PlayerSource} impales you with their {PowerName} for {Damage} points of lethal damage, immobilizing you and reducing your defense!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Aim 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3827903230" "Self +To Hit, +DMG"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Thorn Burst 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2861025649" "Thorn Burst"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1353933233" "PBAoE Melee, Moderate DMG(Lethal), DoT(Toxic) -DEF"
// Power Help Text :
"P3514965151" "You can explode dozens of Thorns in all directions around you. These Thorns only travel a short distance, but they can deal moderate damage and poison any target close to you. Toxic damage from the thorns can reduce the Defense of affected foes. Damage: Moderate, Recharge: Slow"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P2928153054" "You explode your Thorns all around you and impale {PlayerDest} for {Damage} points of lethal damage reducing their defense!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P3025760916" "{PlayerSource} hits you with their {PowerName} for {Damage} points of lethal damage and reduces your defense!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Thorntrops 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2630912946" "Thorntrops"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
// Power Help Text :
"P1444333991" "You fling dozens of Thorns into the ground at a targeted location.  The small Thorns pepper the ground over a large area. Any enemy that pass over the Thorntrops will be forced to move at a slower rate. They will also take some trivial Lethal damage over time. Damage: Minor(DoT), Recharge: Slow"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
// DisplayTargetHelp :

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Ripper 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3665143764" "Melee (Cone), High DMG(Lethal), DoT(Toxic) -DEF, Knockback, -SPD"
// Power Help Text :
"P4247995532" "You can unleash a spectacular slashing maneuver that attacks all foes in a wide arc directly in front of you. Ripper deals massive damage and poisons multiple targets. It can even knock foes down. Thorn poison deals additional Toxic damage and can reduce your foes Defense. Damage: High, Recharge: Slow"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P3752346118" "You slash {PlayerDest} with your mighty {PowerName} for {Damage} points of lethal damage and reduce their defense!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P4075976086" "{PlayerSource} Slashes you with their {PowerName} for {Damage} points of lethal damage and reduces your defense!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Thorn Barrage 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3090654239" "Thorn Barrage"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3320616766" "Close, High DMG(Lethal), DoT(Toxic) -DEF"
// Power Help Text :
"P4119471423" "A short range, but devastating attack. Thorn Barrage unleashes your Thorns at high velocity causing severe damage at close range.  Although these Thorns only travel a short distance,  their  impact can knock most foes on  their  back. Thorn poison deals additional Toxic damage and can reduce your foes Defense. Damage: High, Recharge: Slow"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P2026770664" "{PlayerSource} blasts you with their {PowerName} for {Damage} points of lethal damage and reduces your defense!"

// ******************************************************************************** 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Set : Dual Pistols 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayName :
"P2937018680" "Dual Pistols"
// DisplayHelp :
"P127690582" "You're a master of akimbo pistols, wielding a high caliber fire arm in each hand.  Your attacks primarily deal lethal damage and you have a wide variety of attacks, however your strength lies within your ability to use your "Ammo Swap" power to change out your ammo mid-battle.  Doing so can change your secondary damage type and effects making you an incredibly versatile ranged combatant."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Pistols 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P418306962" "Ranged, Minor DMG(Lethal/Special)"
// Power Help Text :
"P1617853395" "Quickly fires a round from one of your heavy automatic pistols. Damage is average, but the fire rate is very fast.  Damage: Minor, Recharge: Very Fast  NOTE: Changing your ammo type with the 'Swap Ammo' power will change your secondary damage from lethal to cold, fire or toxic."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P1424371251" "You shoot {PlayerDest} with your {PowerName} for {Damage} points of lethal damage."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P4236434635" "{PlayerSource} shoots you with their {PowerName} for {Damage} points of lethal damage!"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P1486918477" "You blast {PlayerDest} with your Standard Rounds for {Damage} bonus points of lethal damage!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P2396128565" "{PlayerSource} shoots you with their Standard Rounds for {Damage} points of bonus lethal damage!"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P1277365587" "You blast {PlayerDest} with your Incendiary Rounds for {Damage} bonus points of fire damage!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P4056626196" "{PlayerSource} shoots you with their Incendiary Rounds for {Damage} points of bonus fire damage!"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P3032004507" "You blast {PlayerDest} with your Cryo Rounds for {Damage} bonus points of cold damage!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P4251115593" "{PlayerSource} shoots you with their Cryo Rounds for {Damage} points of bonus cold damage!"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P1339705472" "You blast {PlayerDest} with your Chemical Rounds for {Damage} bonus points of toxic damage!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P682794024" "{PlayerSource} shoots you with their Chemical for {Damage} points of bonus toxic damage!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Dual Wield 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P684893882" "Ranged, Moderate DMG(Lethal/Special), Foe Knockback/Special"
// Power Help Text :
"P3641815623" "Dual Wield fires both pistols in rapid succession at its desired target.  This power is slower than Pistols, but deals more damage, and the target may get knocked down by the force of the impact. Damage: Moderate, Recharge: Fast  NOTE: Changing your ammo type with the 'Swap Ammo' power will change your secondary damage from lethal to cold, fire or toxic.  Additionally, changing your ammunition type will also change the secondary effect of this attack from Knockback to a minor attack speed and movement speed debuff if 'Cryo Ammo' is loaded, a minor damage over time effect if 'Incendiary Ammo' is loaded, or a -damage effect if 'Chemical Ammo' is loaded."
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P1018046219" "The secondary effect placed on you by a Dual Pistols attack varies depending on the type of ammo used.  If you were struck with Cryo Rounds, you will suffer from a minor slow effect. If you were struck with Incendiary Rounds you will suffer some damage over time.  If you were struck with Chemical Rounds you will have your damage output slightly decreased."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P2879437270" "Your Standard Rounds knock {PlayerDest} off their feet!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P82827437" "{PlayerSource} has knocked you off your feet with their Standard Rounds!"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P3029045350" "Your Incendiary Rounds causes {PlayerDest} to suffer an additional {Damage} points of fire damage."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P3894084503" "{PlayerSource} hits you with their Incendiary Rounds causing you to suffer an additional {Damage} points of fire damage."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P1235441050" "You blast {PlayerDest} with your Cryo Rounds for {Damage} bonus points of cold damage reducing their attack and movement speed!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P20259028" "{PlayerSource} shoots you with their Cryo Rounds for {Damage} points of bonus cold damage reducing  your attack and movement speed!"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P637584215" "You blast {PlayerDest} with your Chemical Rounds for {Damage} bonus points of toxic damage and slightly reduce their damage output!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P1968418963" "{PlayerSource} shoots you with their Chemical for {Damage} points of bonus toxic damage and slightly decreases your damage output!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Empty Clips 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1399859179" "Ranged (Cone), Moderate DMG(Lethal/Special), Knockback/Special"
// Power Help Text :
"P2032745824" "You empty the clips of both your pistols in an arc of suppression fire. This attack can blast multiple foes in the affected cone area, and has a small chance of knocking some foes down. Damage: Moderate, Recharge: Moderate  NOTE: Changing your ammo type with the 'Swap Ammo' power will change your secondary damage from lethal to cold, fire or toxic.  Additionally, changing your ammunition type will also change the secondary effect of this attack from Knockback to a minor attack speed and movement speed debuff if 'Cryo Ammo' is loaded, a minor damage over time effect if 'Incendiary Ammo' is loaded, or a -damage effect if 'Chemical Ammo' is loaded."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Swap Ammo 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2191038984" "Swap Ammo"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P580779526" "Change Secondary Damage/Effects"
// Power Help Text :
"P3274500122" "You are able to swap out the ammunition your weapon uses by using this power.  Swapping out your ammunition will change your secondary damage type on most Dual Pistol attacks from lethal (Standard Rounds), cold (Cryo Rounds), fire (Indendiary Rounds) or toxic (Chemical Rounds).  You can cycle through your ammunition by clicking on this power.  The first press will change your ammo from Standard to Cryo, the second will change the ammo from Cryo to Incendiary, the third press will change from Incendiary to Toxic, and the fourth press will return your ammo back to Standard.  Different ammo types also have different secondary effects.  Examine your Dual Pistol powers for more information."
// DisplayFloat :
"P444371367" "Chemical Ammo Loaded"
// DisplayFloat :
"P3280483388" "Incendiary Ammo Loaded"
// DisplayFloat :
"P2502999507" "Cryo Ammo Loaded"
// DisplayFloat :
"P2954863743" "Standard Ammo Loaded"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Bullet Rain 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1980260676" "Bullet Rain"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1571581867" "Ranged (Targeted AoE), Moderate DMG(Lethal/Special), Knockback/Special"
// Power Help Text :
"P158827151" "You fire your pistols faster than the human eye can follow, causing your bullet trajectory to arc, dealing moderate Lethal damage and possibly knocking your foes back.  Damage: Moderate, Recharge: Slow  NOTE: Changing your ammo type with the 'Swap Ammo' power will change your secondary damage from lethal to cold, fire or toxic.  Additionally, changing your ammunition type will also change the secondary effect of this attack from Knockback to a minor attack speed and movement speed debuff if 'Cryo Ammo' is loaded, a minor damage over time effect if 'Incendiary Ammo' is loaded, or a -damage effect if 'Chemical Ammo' is loaded."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Suppressive Fire 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1434775102" "Suppressive Fire"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3055571" "Ranged, Minor DMG(Lethal/Special), Foe Disorient/Special"
// Power Help Text :
"P2135619701" "Suppressive Fire allows the user to quickly stun their target for a short time and deal a very minor amount of Lethal damage. Damage: Minor, Recharge: Moderate  NOTE: Changing your ammo type with the 'Swap Ammo' power will change your secondary damage from lethal to cold, fire or toxic.  Additionally, changing your ammunition type will also change the secondary effect of this attack from Disorient effect to a Hold effect if 'Cryo Ammo', 'Incendiary Ammo' or 'Chemical Rounds' are loaded."
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P2363889859" "The secondary effect placed on you by a Dual Pistols attack varies depending on the type of ammo used.  If you were struck with Standard Rounds, you will suffer from a Disorient effect. If you were struck with 'Cryo Rounds', 'Incendiary Rounds', or 'Chemical Rounds' you will suffer from a hold effect."
