// Power : Executioner's Shot 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2457212500" "Executioner's Shot"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3226463989" "Close, High DMG(Lethal/Special), Foe Knockback/Special"
// Power Help Text :
"P1595276707" "Executioner's Shot is a deadly close range attack.  Foes struck by this attack will suffer lethal damage and will likely be knocked back by the impact of this attack.  Damage: High, Recharge: Slow  NOTE: Changing your ammo type with the 'Swap Ammo' power will change your secondary damage from lethal to cold, fire or toxic.  Additionally, changing your ammunition type will also change the secondary effect of this attack from Knockback to a minor attack speed and movement speed debuff if 'Cryo Ammo' is loaded, a minor damage over time effect if 'Incendiary Ammo' is loaded, or a -damage effect if 'Chemical Ammo' is loaded."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Piercing Rounds 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1233880528" "Piercing Rounds"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P890029881" "Narrow Ranged (Cone), High DMG(Lethal/Special), Foes -Res(All)/Special"
// Power Help Text :
"P863076175" "You fire your pistols with deadly precision in a very narrow cone, piercing your enemy.  Piercing Rounds deals High lethal damage and reduces targets' Damage Resistance for a short time. Damage: High Recharge: Long  NOTE: Changing your ammo type with the 'Swap Ammo' power will change your secondary damage from lethal to cold, fire or toxic.  Additionally, changing your ammunition type will also change the secondary effect of this attack from a resistance debuff to a minor attack speed and movement speed debuff if 'Cryo Ammo' is loaded, a minor damage over time effect if 'Incendiary Ammo' is loaded, or a -damage effect if 'Chemical Ammo' is loaded."
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P3050567635" "The secondary effect placed on you by a Dual Pistols attack varies depending on the type of ammo used.  If you were struck by 'Standard Rounds' you will have your resistance reduced, 'Cryo Rounds' will inflict a minor slow effect, 'Incendiary Rounds' will cause some damage over time and 'Chemical Rounds' will slightly reduce your damage output."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P2437140420" "You blast {PlayerDest} with your Standard Rounds for {Damage} bonus points of lethal damage and reduce their damage resistance!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P2706707774" "{PlayerSource} shoots you with their Standard Rounds for {Damage} points of bonus lethal damage and reduce their damage resistance!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Hail of Bullets 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2117656133" "Hail of Bullets"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3526677823" "PBAoE, Superior DMG(Lethal/Special), Foe Knockback/Special"
// Power Help Text :
"P2827042441" "You fire a hail of bullets at all enemies around you dealing Extreme lethal damage.  Enemies that are struck have a chance to be knocked down.  Having Standard Rounds will dramatically increase this chance to knock down your foes. Damage: Extreme, Recharge: Very Long  NOTE: Changing your ammo type with the 'Swap Ammo' power will change your secondary damage from lethal to cold, fire or toxic.  Additionally, changing your ammunition type will also change the secondary effect of this attack from a guaranteed knockback effect to a minor attack speed and movement speed debuff if 'Cryo Ammo' is loaded, a minor damage over time effect if 'Incendiary Ammo' is loaded, or a -damage effect if 'Chemical Ammo' is loaded."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P129937747" "You devastate {PlayerDest} with your {PowerName} for {Damage} points of lethal damage!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P907587563" "{PlayerSource} devastates you with their {PowerName} for {Damage} points of lethal damage!"

