"P2677930557" "Demon Summoning"
// DisplayHelp :
"P3908104388" "Conjure demons from the depths of the netherworld and beyond.  These demonic servitors wield hellfire and serve you through some dark compact.  You are capable of summoning a variety of different infernal minions each with its own strengths and weaknesses."

