"P383811230" "Ranged, Minor DMG(Fire), Foe Minor DoT (Toxic), -Res"
// Power Help Text :
"P707677651" "You lash our with your whip firing a bolt of hellfire from its tip corrupting your victim's very living essence dealing minor fire damage, minor toxic damage over time as well as reducing their damage resistance for a short time. Damage: Minor Recharge: Very Fast"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P3237071411" "DoT (Toxic), -Res"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P695963167" "Corruption continues to deal additional toxic damage over time as well as reducing your target's damage resistance."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P2458100842" "You blast {PlayerDest} with your {PowerName} for {Damage} points of fire damage and reduce their damage resistance!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P1852938313" "{PlayerSource} blasts you with their {PowerName} for {Damage} points of fire damage and reduces your damage resistance!"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P2198369131" "{PowerName} deals {Damage} additional points of Toxic damage as hellfire sears {PlayerDest}!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P2741008310" "{PlayerSource} deals an additional {Damage} points of Toxic damage with their {PowerName} as hellfire sears you."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Summon Demonlings 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2691191548" "Summon Demonlings"
// Power Help Text :
"P1375226976" "Call forth up to three demonlings (depending on your level) to do your bidding. The first demonling is adept at manipulating fire, the second blasts your foes with cold attacks and the third is able to wield hellfire to deal fire/toxic damage. You may only have three demonlings under your command at any given time. If you attempt to summon more demonlings, you can only replace those that have been lost in battle. If you already have your maximum allowed amount, the power will fail. Recharge: Very Long"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Lash 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P4276640465" "Lash"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1786463861" "Close, High DMG(Fire), Foe -Res, Knockdown, Minor DoT(Toxic)"
// Power Help Text :
"P79942798" "You channel unholy energies into your whip and Lash out at your foe dealing high fire damage causing toxic damage over time. Lash has longer range than most melee attacks will reduce the target's damage resistance and also has a chance to knockdown your target. Damage: High, Recharge: Moderate"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P849394724" "Lash is causing damage over time and reducing your damage resistance."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P4000079740" "You lash {PlayerName} with whip for {Damage} points of Fire damage and reduce their damage resistance slightly!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P2759161222" "{PlayerSource} slashes you with their {PowerName} for {Damage} points of Fire damage and decreases your damage resistance slightly!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Crack Whip 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3113948439" "Crack Whip"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1768021794" "Short Ranged (Cone), High DMG(Fire), Foe -Res, Knockdown, DoT(Toxic)"
// Power Help Text :
"P3969179973" "You channel hellfire into your whip and make an impressive sweep causing high fire damage to enemies within a wide cone and also cause some toxic damage over time. Whip Crack has a larger range than most melee cones. Targets that are struck will also have their resistance to damage reduced for a short time, may suffer toxic damage over time and may be knocked down. Damage: High, Recharge: Slow"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P629249857" "Crack Whip is causing damage over time and reducing your damage resistance."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P2209248375" "You lash {PlayerName} with your {PowerName} for {Damage} points of Fire damage and reduce their damage resistance slightly!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Summon Demons 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1277955949" "Summon Demons"
// Power Help Text :
"P2662735811" "Summons forth one to two Demons (depending on your level) to do your bidding. The first demon summoned is cloaked in hellfire and has skin as hard as stone while the second demon manipulates flame. You may only have 2 Demons under your control at any given time. If you attempt to call more Demons, you can only replace the ones you have lost in battle. If you already have your maximum allowed number, the power will fail. Recharge: Very Long"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Hell on Earth 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3536278430" "Hell on Earth"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P297969047" "Ranged, Pet +Dmg, +To Hit, Summon Living Hellfire"
// Power Help Text :
"P2363185047" "A dark blessing is placed upon a selected Demon henchman which will increase its damage and chance to hit for 90 seconds. While this is in effect living hellfire may spawn every 15 seconds at the affected Demon henchman's location. The creatures summoned will have a very weak tie to the material plane and will return to Abyss after a short time. Recharge: Very Long"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Summon Demon Prince 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P4266849718" "Summon Demon Prince"
// Power Help Text :
"P2117817070" "Summons forth a foul Demon Prince from the deepest reaches of the Abyss. The Demon Prince is mighty among its kind and is a master of cold powers. It serves the conjuror only so that it may wreak havoc upon the material plane. The Demon has some defense versus lethal, smashing, fire and cold attacks. You may only have 1 Demon Prince under your control at any given time. If you attempt to summon another Demon Prince the power will fail. Recharge: Very Long"

// ******************************************************************************** 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Set : Beast Mastery 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayName :
"P2094940195" "Beast Mastery"
// DisplayHelp :
"P145150698" "Command wild animals to aid you in battle. These beastly allies lack ranged attacks, but make up for it with a specialized focus in melee combat. Call forth wolves, lions, dire wolves, hawks and insects to harass your foes.  Additionally, you have a chance to gain a stack of Pack Mentality when you and your pets land a hit on an enemy.  Each stack of Pack Mentality will boost the damage of all of your nearby beast henchmen.  Pack Mentality can stack up to 10 times and will fade after a short time."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Call Swarm 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P4289027545" "Call Swarm"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1455896769" "Ranged, Light DoT(Lethal), Foe -Defense, -Speed"
// Power Help Text :
"P3345707267" "You summon a swarm of stinging insects to harass your foe causing Light Lethal damage over time and reducing both their movement speed and defense.  This power has a moderate chance at granting your pets a stack of Pack Mentality.  Damage: Light DoT, Recharge: Very Fast"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P2137762428" "-Defense, -Speed"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P1304255405" "The swarm has reduced your defense and movement speed."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P2024820378" "You call forth a swarm of insects upon {PlayerDest} for {Damage} points of Lethal damage reducing their defense and movement speed."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P4258730845" "{PlayerSource} attacks you with a stinging swarm of insects for {Damage} points of Lethal damage and reduces your defense and movement speed."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Summon Wolves 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3412148648" "Summon Wolves"
// Power Help Text :
"P717350789" "Calls forth one to three Wolves to do your bidding. The third one summoned will be an Alpha Wolf, which grants some leadership bonuses to the pack. Wolves have no ranged attacks, but can quickly close in on their prey. You may only have 3 Wolves under your control at any given time. If you attempt to call more Wolves, you can only replace the ones you have lost in battle. If you already have three, the power will fail. Wolf attacks have a chance to build a charge of Pack Mentality.  Pack Mentality is a Damage buff aura that radiates from the Mastermind and can stack up to 10 times.  Recharge: Very Long"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Call Hawk 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1109248985" "Call Hawk"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P711385331" "Ranged, High DMG (Lethal), Foe -To Hit, Knockdown, -Fly"
// Power Help Text :
"P2626277130" "You call forth a hawk ally to swoop in and viciously peck at your target causing High Lethal damage. The attack often catches foes off their guard and can knock them down as well as reducing their chance to hit. This power has a good chance at granting your pets a stack of Pack Mentality.  Damage: High, Recharge: Fast"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P1468139104" "Your chance to hit has been reduced by the Hawk's attack."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P1033344014" "{PlayerSource} knocks {PlayerDest} off their feet with their {PowerName}!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P3390955917" "{PlayerSource} knocks you off your feet with their {PowerName}!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Call Ravens 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1065892017" "Call Ravens"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P425841556" "Ranged (Cone), Moderate DoT(Lethal), Foe -Speed, -Defense, -Fly"
// Power Help Text :
"P453867076" "You command an unkindness of ravens to quickly assault and harass your foes. Your foes will suffer Moderate Lethal damage over time and have their speed and defense reduced. This power has a high chance at granting your pets a stack of Pack Mentality.  Damage: Moderate, Recharge: Slow"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Summon Lions 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1229602555" "Summon Lions"
// Power Help Text :
"P3607249710" "You can summon one to two mighty lions (depending on your level). Lions are one of the most deadly predators on the planet and possess vicious claw and bite attacks as well as growl and roar buffs and debuffs. Like all Henchmen, Lions can be trained to be even more powerful. You may only have 2 Lions under your control at any given time. If you attempt to summon more Lions, you can only replace the ones you have lost in battle. If you already have two, the power will fail. Lion attacks have a chance to build a charge of Pack Mentality.  Pack Mentality is a Damage buff aura that radiates from the Mastermind and can stack up to 10 times.  Recharge: Very Long"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Fortify Pack 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3839028926" "Fortify Pack"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2398434204" "PBAoE, Pets +Defense, +Regeneration, consumes all charges of Pack Mentality"
// Power Help Text :
"P66282508" "You command your beasts to fight more defensively.  Using Fortify Pack will prevent your pets from benefiting from Pack Mentality for 60 seconds.  The number of charges of Pack Mentality you own when activating this power will determine the potency of the Defense and Regeneration buff that will be granted to your pack.  Additionally, simply owning this power grants your beast pets attacks a chance to critically hit that scales with the amount of Pack Mentality owned by the Mastermind.  Recharge: Very Long"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Summon Dire Wolf 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2335021461" "Summon Dire Wolf"
// Power Help Text :
"P17618517" "You call upon the aid of the fabled Dire Wolf. It has powerful bite and breath attacks.  Unlike wolves and lions, the Dire Wolf has some limited ranged attacks. The Dire Wolf has good defense to Melee, Ranged and AoE attacks and good resistance to Cold damage. You may only have 1 Dire Wolf under your control at any given time. If you attempt to summon another Dire Wolf the power will fail.  Dire Wolf attacks have a chance to build a charge of Pack Mentality.  Pack Mentality is a Damage buff aura that radiates from the Mastermind and can stack up to 10 times.  Recharge: Very Long"

// ******************************************************************************** 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Set : Kinetic Attack 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayName :
"P3267007910" "Kinetic Melee"
// DisplayShortHelp :
"P3651790198" "Kinetic Attack"
// DisplayHelp :
"P2553740608" "Kinetic Melee features a mix of fast light attacks and slow heavy attacks, including some with range.  All attacks in this set reduce the damage strength of enemies who are hit."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Quick Strike 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3807885890" "Quick Strike"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3814896443" "Melee, Light DMG(Smash/Energy), Foe -DMG, 33%% KD"
// Power Help Text :
"P1388643021" "A quick attack that sometimes knock foes down. Fast, but low damage. Damage: Low, Recharge: Fast"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Body Blow 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3513231302" "Body Blow"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3369676297" "Melee, Moderate DMG(Smash/Energy), +Stun"
// Power Help Text :
"P3966281746" "A much more powerful, yet slower version of Quick Strike. Body Blow is capable of stunning an opponent occasionally. Damage: Moderate, Recharge: Moderate"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Smashing Blow 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P4204759503" "Smashing Blow"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
// Power Help Text :
"P673707641" "Smashing Blow is a slow attack, but makes up for it with a good amount of damage. Has a greater chance to stun than body blow. Damage: High, Recharge: Moderate"
// Effect VictimHit Message :

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Power Siphon 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3699860912" "Power Siphon"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3458108864" "Self: +To Hit, +Special"
// Power Help Text :
"P4052767385" "Power Siphon adds a small bonus to hit and modifies your other Kinetic Attack powers, so they are now capable of draining the strength of your enemies and adding that strength to you. This effect will stack up to 5 times. Recharge: Very Long"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Repulsing Torrent 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P268745046" "Repulsing Torrent"
// Power Help Text :
"P195978086" "Repulsing Torrent unleashes a cone of powerful energy that can smash foes and possibly send them flying. Damage: Moderate, Recharge: Slow"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Burst 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3285509140" "PBAoE Melee, Moderate DMG(Smash/Energy), Knockdown"
// Power Help Text :
"P807261079" "By focusing your energy into the muscles in your arms, you can launch a dizzying flurry of attacks against every foe in melee range. Some foes may be hit hard enough to be knocked down as well. Damage: Moderate, Recharge: Slow"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Focused Burst 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3256943054" "Focused Burst"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3997855460" "Ranged, High DMG(Smash/Energy), Knockdown"
// Power Help Text :
"P3555408942" "Projects a burst of focused power over a short distance.  Focused Burst deals high damage and can possibly knock down your foe. Damage: High, Recharge: Moderate"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P2000319398" "{PlayerSource} Strikes you with Focus for {Damage} points of smashing damage!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P1880139445" "{PlayerSource} Strikes you with Focus for {Damage} points of energy damage!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Total Focus 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3687894522" "Concentrated Strike"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P406196269" "Melee, Extreme DMG(Energy/Smash), Foe Disorient, +Special"
// Power Help Text :
"P2491047709" "Concentrated Strike is a slow, but incredibly devastating attack that can knock out most opponents, leaving them Disoriented. Due to the exhausting nature of Concentrated Strike, recharge time is very long.  Concentrated Strike Criticals do not result in extra damage, instead it instantly recharges the Power Siphon power. Damage: Extreme"

// ******************************************************************************** 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Set : Electric Control 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayName :
"P2339549431" "Electric Control"
// DisplayHelp :
"P2149248823" "Electricity leaps and sparks at your command.  You can use raw electrical power to paralyze, knockdown and drain the endurance of foes."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Electric Fence 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1526741235" "Ranged, Moderate DoT(Energy), Foe Immobilize, -End, -Fly, -Knockback"
// Power Help Text :
"P2440390348" "Surrounds and Immobilizes a single target in an Electric Fence. Deals some damage over time and slowly drains some Endurance. Useful for keeping villains at bay and bringing down fliers. Damage: Minor(DoT), Recharge: Fast"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P3427980061" "Dot(Energy), Immobilize, -End, -Fly, -KB"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
// Effect VictimHit Message :

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Tesla Cage 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1553130658" "Ranged, Moderate DMG(Energy), Foe Hold, -End"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Chain Fences 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3661323479" "Chain Fences"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1871849814" "Ranged AoE, Minor DMG(Energy), Foe Immobilize, -End, -Fly"
// Power Help Text :
"P831105298" "You can immobilize multiple foes in a chain of electricity, dealing minor damage to all foes in range and draining some endurance.  This power also reduces Flight capacity in targets. Damage: Minor, Recharge: Moderate"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P3216850077" "Immobilize, -End, -Fly"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P2690516670" "You are immobilized and your flight capability reduced by the Chain Fences."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Jolting Chain 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3186708883" "Jolting Chain"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3367567124" "Ranged Chain AoE, Minor DMG(Energy), Foe Knockdown, -End"
// Power Help Text :
"P2067335990" "You can send a bolt of electricity through multiple opponents, causing a muscle spasm and dealing minor damage.  Each foe is knocked down, and the electric charge can fork several times, jumping to several opponents rapidly.  Damage: Minor, Recharge: Moderate"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P2213400709" "Knockdown, -End"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Stunning Aura 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2659011467" "Conductive Aura"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3425504256" "Toggle: PBAoE, Foe -End, Self +Rec, +Regen"
// Power Help Text :
"P702028802" "While this power is active, the air around you becomes charged with electricity, leaping out and shocking foes that get too close.  Foes will lose some endurance, while you gain Recovery and Regeneration per target hit. Recharge: Slow"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P1175493268" "You have been hit by the Conductive Aura!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Static Field 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3286362090" "Static Field"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P27120137" "Target (Location AoE), Foe Sleep, -End"
// Power Help Text :
"P3271222473" "You can build up a Static Field at a nearby location. Any foes in the field may lose control of their muscles due to the static charge, and will shake violently.  Foes may also be drained of some endurance, and some of that endurance may be transferred to nearby allies. Any attack will interrupt the effect temporarily and foes will re-gain control, although their movement and attack rates will be reduced.  This effect can last for some time, and will continue to paralyze foes in the field.  Recharge: Slow"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P126903745" "Sleep, -End"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P625742039" "You are temporarily paralyzed by the static field."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Paralyzing Blast 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2075115033" "Paralyzing Blast"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3179859045" "Ranged AoE, Foe Hold, -End"
// Power Help Text :
"P2017388294" "Summoning a large amount of energy, you can completely paralyze a group of foes in cages of electricity for a short time.  These foes may be drained of some endurance as well.  Recharge: Very Long"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P1220245880" "You have been caged by the Paralyzing Blast."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Synaptic Overload 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3263998155" "Synaptic Overload"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P711874253" "Ranged Chain AoE, Foe Confuse, -End"
// Power Help Text :
"P1798939764" "This power can subtly scramble the synapses of any target affected, causing hallucinations and confusion amongst foes.  The electric charge lasts for some time, and will jump slowly to other opponents causing wide spread confusion.  Foes may not be aware that this has happened, and will not be alerted to your presence.  You will also not receive experience for any damage dealt by confused opponents. Recharge: Slow"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P4006396885" "Confuse, -End"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P2909616078" "Your neurons have been scrambled by the Synaptic Overload."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P1196504450" "{PlayerSource} scrambles your senses with their {PowerName}, confusing you!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Gremlins 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P9578033" "Gremlins"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1317979993" "Summon Gremlins: Melee Minor DMG(Energy)"
// Power Help Text :
"P2133657360" "Mastery over electricity allows you to create almost sentient elementals of lightning.  These elementals are mischievous in nature, and enjoy creating havoc and interfering with electronic equipment or magical cantrips.  They also never work alone, where there is one Gremlin, there is often another nearby. Recharge: Very Long"

