// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1011918225" "Projectile Vomit"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3014490551" "DoT(Toxic)"
// Power Help Text :
"P3172658322" "The Zombies can Projectile Vomits a corrosive bile that deals Toxic damage over time."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P330613497" "{PlayerSource} hits {PlayerDest} with their {PowerName} for {Damage} points of toxic damage!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P3293717725" "{PlayerSource} Projectile Vomits on you for {Damage} points of Toxic damage!"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P4266582243" "Projectile Vomit continues to burn away at {PlayerDest} for {damage} points of Toxic damage."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P1170022741" "Zombie Vomit continues to burn away at you for {damage} points of Toxic damage."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Zombie Vomit 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1592855932" "Zombie Vomit"
// Power Help Text :
"P499042193" "The Zombie's toxic vomits is burning your flesh."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P2076037517" "{PlayerSource} vomits on you for {Damage} points of Toxic damage!"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P553100935" "Zombie Vomit continues to burn away at {PlayerDest} for {damage} points of Toxic damage."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Enchant 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2091019232" "Enchant"
// Power Help Text :
"P1620618570" "This Zombie has been Empowered. He can now Vomit and Projectile Vomit."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
