// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1506893330" "Ranged (Narrow Cone), Moderate DMG(Cold), Minor DoT(Cold), -Rech, -Speed, -Fly"
// Power Help Text :
"P4160789205" "The Dire Wolf lets out a concentrated, but narrow blast of arctic air that chills foes causing Moderate Cold damage and additional lingering Cold damage as well as reducing the target's movement and attack speeds. Damage: Moderate, Recharge: Moderate"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P1286666794" "Minor DoT(Cold), -Fly, -Rech, -Speed"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P2356236683" "You're suffering cold damage over time and have your movement and recharge rate reduced slightly."
