"P339885493" "{PlayerSource} chills you with their {PowerName} for {Damage} points of cold damage and reduces your movement and attack speed!"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P1945196818" "{PlayerSource} continues to chill you with their {PowerName} for {Damage} points of cold damage!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
