"P2312255126" "Freezing Roar"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P4104590061" "Ranged (Cone), Moderate DMG(Cold), Minor DoT(Cold), -Rech, -Speed, -Fly"
// Power Help Text :
"P4119678986" "The Dire Wolf breathes out freezing air in a broad cone in front of it chilling all foes for Moderate Cold damage and lingering Cold Damage over time.  Affected foes will also have their movement and attack speeds reduced.  Damage: Moderate, Recharge: Long"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
