"P2901772066" "Terrible Howl"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1429329392" "PBAoE, High DMG(Cold), Foe Terrorize, Minor DoT(Cold), -Rech, -Speed"
// Power Help Text :
"P3151944946" "The Dire Wolf is capable of letting out a Terrible Roar that will cause High Cold damage, slow and terrorize all nearby foes for a short time. Recharge: Long"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Will of the Wild 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3251859872" "Will of the Wild"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2151143074" "Self, +Max HP, +Res(Lethal, Smash, Fire, Cold)"
// Power Help Text :
"P1552976442" "When the Dire Wolf is dangerously low on health it will become enraged and suffer significantly less damage for a short time as well as recovering a portion of its health. Once this power wears off it will leave it partially drained of endurance.  Recharge: Very Long"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
